window.__T__=[{"i":18920,"text":"x VOL.040\n\n今天我做的最满意的提示词\n🌷\n\n小人的出现，不是为了卖萌。\n它更像照片里的另一个视角。\n可能是在回应。\n可能是在吐槽。\n可能是在替画面说出一句没有说出口的话。\n\n所以每张图最后呈现出来的感觉都会不一样。\n因为它不是套一个固定模板，而是根据照片自己的故事生长出来。\n\n完整提示词：\n\n```\n同样处理：\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有生活方式杂志、独立出版物和艺术摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分先理解原图真正的**视觉核心与寓意**：判断画面最重要的不是“有什么”，而是“什么最值得被记住”——可能是一个主体、一种动作、一组关系、一处反差、一个情绪瞬间或某种象征意味。再从中提取最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态、空间关系与叙事线索**，重构为“真实主体 + 黑线涂鸦小人”的趣味编辑海报。不要机械截取原图最大物体，而要保留最能代表照片精神和故事性的视觉锚点，使下半部分既能一眼对应原图，又像对原图进行了一次聪明的二次解读。\n\n真实主体保持材质与身份特征，可适度优化角度、比例、光线和色彩，使核心特征更鲜明；原图中与寓意无关的信息可以舍弃，但支撑主题的关键关系必须保留。围绕主体加入少量极简黑线涂鸦小人，小人的动作、位置和互动方式完全根据原图的形态、语境与潜在寓意自然生成，让他们像在回应、放大或反转照片原本的故事，而不是随意做动作。\n\n配色从上方照片中提取最有辨识度和精气神的颜色，可适度提纯、提亮和重新组织。背景以米白、浅色或原图中最舒适的浅色为主，保持大量留白；真实主体承担主要色彩，小人与文字以黑色或深灰细线形成对比，整体干净、轻快、克制。\n\n文字同样从原图的**核心寓意、情绪和视觉关系**中自然生长，不直接说明物体名称，也不套固定文案。将照片最值得被记住的那层意思转化成极短、轻松、聪明、略带幽默或双关的手写文字，让它像小人留下的注释、念头或一句画外音。文字可沿主体轮廓、人物动作或留白节奏自由排布，与小人和主体共同完成叙事，而不是后期贴上的标题。\n\n整体保持**真实主体、核心寓意、微型叙事、稚拙线条和大量留白**之间的平衡。无论原图是人物、动物、植物、食物、建筑、器物、交通工具或自然场景，都应先抓住“这张照片真正讲的是什么”，再决定如何重构，避免只抓物体不抓关系、只做可爱互动没有主题、卡通贴纸感、复杂装饰和模板感。\n\n💣language：english\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQS6jpxa4AAlfjB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQS6mtfbAAAYARn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQS6oYFbQAAQ5rx.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQS6qc_aUAAvrBO.jpg"]},{"i":18921,"text":"Luxury magazine-style portrait for your personal brand.\n\n[ Portrait Series - Part 1 ]\n\nPrompt:\n\n{ \n  \"prompt_type\": \"ultra_realistic_candid_portrait\", \n  \"subject\": { \n    \"identity\": \"[Person Name/ Uploaded Image]\", \n    \"identity_note\": \"Preserve the exact facial identity, hairstyle, beard, and overall appearance of {{person_name}} as accurately as possible\", \n    \"pose\": \"seated indoors, relaxed and natural body language\", \n    \"gaze\": \"looking slightly off to the side, calm and introspective expression\", \n    \"eyewear\": \"dark sunglasses\" \n  }, \n  \"attire\": { \n    \"top\": \"loose-fitting white linen shirt\", \n    \"collar\": \"open collar, unbuttoned at the top\", \n    \"sleeves\": \"long sleeves, slightly rolled or relaxed\", \n    \"fit\": \"casual, breathable, effortless drape\" \n  }, \n  \"composition\": { \n    \"shot_type\": \"medium close-up\", \n    \"angle\": \"three-quarter side profile\", \n    \"framing\": \"partially obscured by soft blurred foreground elements such as leaves and a doorway edge, giving depth and a candid observational feel\", \n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"vertical 3:4\" \n  }, \n  \"lighting\": { \n    \"source\": \"warm late-afternoon sunlight entering from the side\", \n    \"effect\": \"soft highlights across the face and shirt, deep cinematic shadows\", \n    \"background\": \"dark, elegant, softly out of focus interior\" \n  }, \n  \"photographic_style\": { \n    \"depth_of_field\": \"shallow with creamy bokeh\", \n    \"texture\": \"realistic skin detail, natural facial hair rendering\", \n    \"grain\": \"subtle film grain\", \n    \"color_grade\": \"muted, warm tones\", \n    \"genre\": \"premium editorial lifestyle photography\", \n    \"lens_simulation\": \"85mm lens, f/1.8 aperture\", \n    \"realism_level\": \"highly detailed, photorealistic\" \n  }, \n  \"output_requirements\": { \n    \"consistency\": \"generate the same final image style, mood, lighting, framing, and attire regardless of who {{person_name}} is\", \n    \"variable_input\": \"only the person's name changes; all other elements remain fixed\" \n  } \n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ50vfzbMAAvGfa.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ50vfqakAAnqeY.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ50vfzbUAAprt6.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ50vftaEAAQh6s.jpg"]},{"i":18922,"text":"之前10万人喜欢我一组提示词， 用来批量制作图片\n\n效果还是一如往常的专业稳定\n\n我喜欢要求一次输出10张，每张要求不同的信息\n这点GPT-image2 太会了\n\n完整汤底提示词，结尾你可以自行佐料：\n```\n设计一张具有高级商业审美的极简海报，核心视觉语言是“真实物象穿越几何情绪窗口”。画面中设置一个窄长的低饱和色块，作为视觉锚点和空间容器，色块颜色根据主题选择柔和浅色，如雾蓝、浅青、米白、淡粉、暖灰或浅金。将【核心物象】以真实摄影质感或精细写实方式置入色块之中，但不要完全困在色块内，要让主体局部越界、破框、延伸到留白区域，形成自然生长感和空间穿透感。背景保持极简，使用大面积白色或浅灰留白，加入几乎透明的文化纹样、线性图形、地形线、水波线、光影轮廓或抽象符号，作为若隐若现的视觉细节。整体排版要像高端地产、奢侈品、美学杂志或节气海报，文字细长、克制、字距舒展，标题可竖排，辅助信息用小字号规整排列。画面需要有东方留白、现代秩序、自然生命力、轻奢品质感。避免杂乱、避免高饱和、避免厚重阴影、避免廉价模板感。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSU96-aoAAex4z.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSVFBjaUAElLPs.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSVJsPa4AAlsQ4.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSVLHrbMAACljs.jpg"]},{"i":18923,"text":"x VOL.401\n\n折腾好久，终于磨完成这套提示词了\n\n灵感来自达芬奇还有宜家的产品说明书\n\n提示词：\n```\n💦\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物和展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系**，以 **isometric 等距空间逻辑重新构建**。不是把原物简单变成3D模型，而是将主体拆解为清晰的体块、层级、切面与空间关系，在统一等距轴线中重新组合，使其兼具建筑模型般的结构秩序与编辑插画般的视觉概括。可适度调整观察角度、比例和局部结构，以更好地展示主体最有代表性的形态，但必须保持一眼可识别的身份特征。\n\n同时从照片的核心内容、动作、结构或象征关系中提炼一个**主题意象**，将其几何化、符号化并融入isometric构图。主题意象可以成为底座、切面、空间缺口、路径、包围结构或负形，让主体与其发生穿越、嵌合、悬浮、切割、承托或错层关系，使主题不是附加装饰，而是决定主体如何存在于空间中的构图机制。\n\n构图根据主体的视觉重心、轮廓走势和空间特性自适应设计，通过等距轴线、体块比例、层级错落、尺度反差、局部裁切和大面积留白建立专业秩序。主体不必机械居中，可偏置、悬浮或延伸，让isometric结构与主题意象共同形成唯一视觉中心。\n\n主体采用**高明度、清透、柔和的日系配色与细腻哑光材质**。颜色从上方照片中提取最有生命力、最能代表主体精气神的色彩重新调制，以柔白、奶油白或极浅暖色作为基础，将核心色转化为干净、明亮、轻柔的色面，通过同色深浅和少量点色区分不同体块。光影柔和而明确，用轻微明暗帮助读取结构，避免厚重3D阴影、塑料材质和灰脏色调。\n\n背景保持大量留白，并加入**达·芬奇手稿式的创作研究痕迹**：与主体相关的轮廓草图、结构拆解、局部放大、比例线、测量线、箭头、几何推演、自然观察线稿和微型注释，以极淡的铅笔、赭色墨线或褪色手稿质感若隐若现地分布在主体周围。手稿应像设计过程留下的思考轨迹，与精确的isometric主体形成“理性成品与感性研究过程”的对照，不形成第二视觉中心。\n\n文字同样围绕主题和空间结构组织。从照片的主体身份、动作、情绪或象征意义中提炼一个简短英文标题，并搭配极少量地点、状态词或微型注释。文字可以沿isometric轴线、主题意象边界、结构切面或手稿辅助线排列，横排、竖排、错位、穿插或隐藏于负形中，使文字像设计图纸和高级艺术出版物中的信息层，而不是后期贴上的标题。\n\n整体呈现**主题隐喻 × Isometric空间秩序 × 达·芬奇式研究手稿 × 日系清透色彩 × 东方留白 × 高级编辑设计**的视觉气质。无论主体是人物、动物、植物、建筑、器物、食物、交通工具或自然景观，都应以其自身结构找到最合适的等距重构方式，避免普通3D模型、游戏场景感、轴测工程图感、卡通低多边形、机械居中、电商展示感和模板感。\n\n💦\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQS6jpxa4AAlfjB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQS6mtfbAAAYARn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQS6oYFbQAAQ5rx.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQS6qc_aUAAvrBO.jpg"]},{"i":18924,"text":"x VOL.042\n\n下半张顺着主体自己的比例、轴线、方向和空间关系\n重画成一张 isometric 水彩研究图。\n\nprompt by xiaoxiaodong:\n\n```\n🧜‍♀️ \n同样处理：\n\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、比例、视角、朝向、透视、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体，不得混入其他对象或替换原始内容。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系**，重构为一张 **isometric 风格逻辑的结构解构水彩研究图**。上传的原始照片是唯一依据，主体的身份、几何形态、比例、观察方向、空间关系、主要颜色与尺度参照只能来自原图。不要直接贴用照片，不要做前后对比、拼贴或摄影切片。\n\n重绘时先识别原图中的核心主体、主轴线、原始观察方向、前中后景关系、3–7 个最重要的辨识特征、4–6 种主要颜色，以及能够体现尺度的环境线索。保留主体的整体轮廓、总体比例、原始视角、对称或非对称关系、关键构件关系、决定身份的细节与主要材质色彩，让人一眼看出与上方是同一对象。\n\n主体采用 **isometric 重绘逻辑**，以清晰、克制、专业的轴测式空间表达重新组织，但仍然忠于原图的结构关系与观看逻辑。根据主体真实结构，将其拆分为 2–5 个有意义的完整层级或构件：建筑、器物或组合物体可沿屋顶、楼层、壳体、框架、基座、模块或连接体解构；景观或空间可按前景、中景、背景与空间围合层次展开；人物、动物或植物保持身体完整，只通过重叠轮廓、姿态层、动作线和表面色块表达，禁止肢解、解剖或机械零件化。所有分层都应沿真实轴线或透视方向克制分离，层间距均匀适中，共享同一中心轴与空间网格，并保留一个完整、稳定、细节最丰富的基座或锚点区域，让观众能够在脑中重新组装主体。\n\n下半部分构图保持专业、克制、编辑化。主体居中或根据原图重心轻微偏置，四周保留充足留白，稳定基座位于下部或中心，分离的结构层沿真实轴线向上、向外或向景深方向展开。避免戏剧化碎裂、过度爆炸图、无意义装饰与机械感拆解。整体像一张完成度很高的研究型编辑海报，而不是工程说明书。\n\n绘画语言采用 **温暖象牙白水彩纸底上的建筑结构解构水彩研究图** 气质，可结合清晰线稿、半透明水彩色块、少量结构辅助线与克制的分析性标记。保留轻微纸纹、细致笔触、透明叠色和理性留白，使其既有研究图的知识感，也有艺术出版物的优雅感。色彩从原图提取并适度提纯，保持清澈、准确、克制与有精气神，避免灰脏、厚重、过度渲染和廉价 CG 感。\n\n文字作为构图的一部分，以 **研究图 / 编辑注释** 的方式自然介入。从照片的主体身份、主题、动作、状态或象征意义中提炼一个简短标题，并搭配极少量编号、结构标记、侧向注释、材料词、状态词或微型说明。文字保持细长、克制、专业，可沿轴线、分层方向、留白边缘或结构标注位置横排、竖排、错位排列，使其像建筑研究、水彩观察图与高级编辑设计之间的结合，而不是普通海报标题。\n\n整体呈现 **isometric 结构逻辑、专业解构秩序、水彩研究质感、编辑留白与高级出版气质**。无论主体是建筑、人物、动物、植物、器物、交通工具、街景、室内或自然景观，下半部分都应从原图自身结构中生长出最恰当的解构方式，保持高度适配性与可迁移性。避免模板化爆炸图、复杂科技 UI、肢解感、机械零件感、卡通感、电商感和无依据的结构杜撰。\n\n整体保持**真实主体、核心寓意、微型叙事、稚拙线条和大量留白**之间的平衡。无论原图是人物、动物、植物、食物、建筑、器物、交通工具或自然场景，都应先抓住“这张照片真正讲的是什么”，再决定如何重构，避免只抓物体不抓关系、只做可爱互动没有主题、卡通贴纸感、复杂装饰和模板感。\n\n🧜‍♀️\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQTHPTLaEAAxFAE.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQTHUcXaEAAOrM0.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQTHucxaEAA1i_q.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQTI7cGaMAAWT8o.jpg"]},{"i":18925,"text":"Preserve the original scene, composition, perspective, buildings, streets, objects, lighting, shadows, materials, and photographic textures exactly. Change only the characters into minimalist black-and-white hand-drawn stickers,\nkeeping their poses, actions, proportions, clothing outlines, number, and positions unchanged. Use rough single-line illustrations with only pure black and white no gray,color, or gradients with clean white sticker borders. Create a realistic high-resolution photo background contrasted with flat 2D sketch characters, in a minimalist graffiti/INS editorial collage style. Sharp, detailed, photorealistic background, 8K look. Aspect ratio: 3:4 / 9:16.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQTbCHyacAAyY1x.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQTbCH8a0AAOLbx.jpg"]},{"i":18926,"text":"x 补充\n\n这组提示词，有日本阿婆主使用后\n20万展示了\n\n为什么ta不标注灵感来自我呢？\n奇怪\n\n我也给出这个提示词英文版：\n\n```\nPlease turn each photo I upload into a separate, standalone premium design poster. Do not create multi-image collages; each photo must be output individually. Use an overall 3:4 vertical composition, with the upper and lower sections divided in a strict 1:1 height ratio, each occupying exactly 50% of the canvas.\n\nThe upper half should preserve the original photograph, maintaining the subject’s structure, realistic texture, natural lighting, and original color atmosphere. Apply only subtle, high-end photographic color grading so that the image feels like an art magazine, independent publication, or exhibition photograph. To adapt the image to the required aspect ratio, you may naturally extend the sky, ground, or surrounding environment, but do not stretch, distort, or alter the subject itself.\n\nThe lower half should extract the most recognizable subject, silhouette, pose, and narrative relationship from the photograph and reinterpret them as a minimalist, handcrafted layered paper-cut and paper-sculpture collage. Use one core subject as the visual anchor, simplifying its essential silhouette, proportions, and structure through folding, cutting, layering, and overlapping rather than mechanically reproducing every detail. Then select only a small number of environmental relationships from the original image and transform them into foreground, midground, and background paper layers. Establish clear hierarchy through differences in scale, compositional axes, positive and negative space, front-to-back overlap, and generous areas of empty space. The subject should remain immediately recognizable while maintaining the restraint, precision, and order of contemporary editorial design.\n\nExtract the most distinctive and energetic colors from the upper photograph and translate them into a limited, harmonious paper color palette. Use warm ivory or a light-toned paper surface as the base, then create spatial depth with a dominant color, a darker structural tone, lighter layering tones, and only a very small amount of accent color. Use refined matte cardstock with visible paper fibers, crisp cut edges, and soft contact shadows. Lighting should be naturally diffused to emphasize the thickness of folded layers and the authentic tactile quality of handmade paper. Avoid plastic-looking 3D rendering, cheap craft-paper aesthetics, neon colors, and complex gradients.\n\nCreate a complete high-end editorial micro-typography system. Based on the subject’s identity, location, action, material, mood, or symbolic meaning, derive one short main title, accompanied by 2–4 groups of very small supporting text. These may flexibly combine the object or subject name, location information, numbering, chapter markers, serial numbers, coordinate-style numerals, directional words, status words, material descriptors, category labels, or one extremely short poetic annotation. Do not use years or dates. The main title should provide recognition and emotional tone, while the small text should create structure, rhythm, sophistication, and editorial precision.\n\nTypography must be composed together with the paper-cut graphics rather than placed separately. Text may follow the edges of paper layers, the contour of the subject, geometric axes, or negative space. It may also appear horizontally, vertically, rotated, widely tracked, aligned tightly to edges, anchored into corners, crossing color blocks, embedded between paper layers, or partially obscured and interwoven with the main subject. The main title may be moderately transformed into paper-cut or folded-paper letterforms, while the supporting typography should remain thin, restrained, and contemporary. Use strong contrasts in type size, direction, and orientation to create a deliberate reading path, so that the paper artwork creates the visual memory while the micro-typography creates the premium editorial order.\n\nThe overall visual language should combine real photography × handcrafted paper cutting × high-end editorial design. The result should feel clean, elegant, tactile, contemporary, refined, and collectible. Regardless of whether the subject is a person, animal, plant, architecture, object, vehicle, or natural landscape, always maintain one primary subject, a limited number of paper layers, generous negative space, and precise micro-typography. Avoid childish craft aesthetics, excessive visual stacking, duplicated subjects, e-commerce presentation styles, and obvious template-like compositions.\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQUbNHhbYAAcpzK.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQUbOeUa8AASERA.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQUbQQ5agAASvbv.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQUbVnEbYAA-c4B.jpg"]},{"i":18927,"text":"x VOL.045\n\n感觉自己做提示词，渐入佳境\n这组灵感来自于，小孩子的积木\n\n转换之后的画面好有意思。\n\n完整提示词 \ncreate by xiaoxiaodong:\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、空间关系、真实材质、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系**，按照“解构—筛选—提炼—重构”的逻辑，转化为具有 **3D / isometric 空间感的治愈系积木雕塑**。重点保留主体最独特的体量比例、轴线、曲线、穿插、层叠、遮挡与负空间，以圆润、简洁、具有触感的模块化体块重新组织；不完整复刻细节，但必须一眼感受到与上方原图的对应。\n\n构图根据主体自身的视觉重心、姿态方向和空间关系自适应设计，通过大小体块、高低错层、前后穿插、局部悬浮、疏密变化与大面积留白建立节奏。积木可以拼接、叠放、嵌套、穿越或自然错位，使主体既保留身份，又具有当代艺术玩具般的雕塑感和轻松想象力，避免机械拆件和简单像素化。\n\n**配色必须从上方原图本身分析产生。** 先识别照片中最有生命力、最有辨识度的主色关系，以及综合色温、明度层级、冷暖呼应和关键点色，再将这些颜色重新调制为更柔和、清澈、明亮、有空气感的治愈色彩体系。保留原图的色相身份与情绪记忆，但适度提高明度、降低刺眼对比、净化灰脏杂色，使颜色呈现温柔、童趣、轻盈而高级的感觉。不同照片应自然得到不同配色，不固定使用任何预设色卡，也不要为了“治愈感”强行加入原图不存在的颜色。\n\n色彩通过**主色面积、辅助色层次、同源深浅与极少量鲜活点色**建立节奏，让主体看起来丰富但不杂乱、可爱但不甜腻、柔和但有精气神。积木材质采用细腻哑光、柔和漫反射的质感，带轻微纸浆、木质、粉蜡或柔性材料般的触感，边角圆润、阴影轻柔，避免塑料高光、金属感、厚重CG和廉价玩具质感。\n\n文字建立轻盈的高级编辑式微排版系统，从照片的光影、动作、空间、情绪或象征意义中提炼一个2–5词的标题，并搭配少量状态词、地点、编号、方向词或微型注释，不使用年份。文字可沿积木边缘、模块缝隙、视觉轴线或负空间排列，也可与体块形成穿插、遮挡与对齐，让文字自然成为积木构图的一部分。\n\n整体呈现 **真实摄影 × 治愈积木 × isometric空间 × 原图色彩转译 × 高级编辑设计** 的视觉气质，温柔、轻盈、童趣、安静、精致、有想象力但不幼稚。无论主体是人物、动物、植物、建筑、器物、食物、交通工具或自然景观，都应从原图自身的结构与色彩中发展出独特的积木组合和配色方式，避免固定色卡、乐高式复制、儿童卡通、电商玩具展示感和模板感。\n\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQXrOaFb0AAgHbh.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQXrSePaAAA9ZPO.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQXrT6wa4AANlxa.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQXrVbna4AAm6My.jpg"]},{"i":18928,"text":"使用图1作为【产品】唯一参考，严格保持产品外形、包装比例、颜色、材质、瓶盖、按钮、接口及已授权标识一致，不得重新设计产品。\n\n生成一张3:4竖版“产品剖面剧场”商业广告。产品位于画面中央，沿一条清晰、优雅的切面打开，保留部分完整外壳，使观众能够同时看见产品外观和内部世界。\n\n剖面由四层组成：\n\n① 外壳与包装结构\n② 内部材料、成分或核心零件\n③ 产品发挥作用的过程\n④ 将【核心利益点】转化成可见的超现实景观\n\n内部不是杂乱零件，而是一座精心布置的微型舞台。例如：护肤品内部形成水分循环花园；耳机内部呈现声波剧场；运动鞋中底出现缓震能量层；食品内部展示真实原料、酱汁与香气路径。\n\n所有结构保持明确的上下层级与物理连接，切面干净，部件不可随机漂浮。高级棚拍，70毫米微距镜头，深色渐变背景，侧上方硬柔结合主光，精细轮廓光，真实材质、锐利细节和电影级商业质感。\n\n不要医学透视感、廉价三维模型、杂乱标注、过多文字、无意义齿轮、错误零件和虚假功能。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n普通爆炸图回答“它由什么组成”，产品剖面剧场还要回答：\n\n这些结构能给人带来什么感受。\n\n真实结构负责建立可信度，超现实景观负责传达价值，两者不能混成一团。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n• 护肤品：成分、渗透路径与保湿屏障\n• 食品饮料：原料、夹层、酱汁与香气\n• 鞋服：面料结构、透气层与缓震系统\n• 数码产品：镜头模组、电池和声学空间\n• 文化器物：胎体、釉层、纹样与制作工艺\n\n⚙️ 参数技巧\n\n一张图只解释一个核心利益点。不要同时塞入保湿、美白、修护、抗老等全部功能。\n\n真实商品的内部结构与功效必须依据产品资料；如果使用想象性结构，应明确作为“创意概念图”，避免把视觉隐喻包装成技术事实。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n好的产品剖面，不只是把东西切开，而是把“为什么值得买”藏进内部。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQVhn8AawAACtlC.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQVhpG9aEAAq16X.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQVhpxZakAAFGkF.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQVhrR7b0AE0MVH.jpg"]},{"i":18929,"text":"x VOL.046\n\n可爱帅气的我，又打磨了一套提示词\n\n这种厚涂风格，有点点油画的感觉\n配色也特别强调要明亮一点点的了\n很好的感觉\n\nprompt by xiaoxiaodong，使用请注明引用:\n```\n🪁\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、比例、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系**，重构为一张 **3D厚涂油画风格的微景观插画海报**。不要机械复刻照片，而是将主体转化为精致、立体、可触摸的微缩景观，以厚涂笔触、色彩堆叠和雕塑般的体积感重新塑造；保留主体核心身份和关键特征，同时适度优化角度、比例与细节，使其更适合微景观式呈现。\n\n构图采用**大面积留白 + 居中或轻微偏心的斜向主轴**。在明亮白色纹理纸面上，以一抹与原图主题相关的清透厚涂色带承托主体，可转化为水面、地面、路径、光带或抽象风景切片；主体与色带自然交互，并根据内容加入倒影、波纹、光斑或延展笔触。背景仅保留少量厚涂云层、太阳、雾气或主题相关的自然意象，形成轻盈而富有诗意的空间层次。\n\n绘画语言强调**厚涂油画 × 微缩实体 × 清透光感**。保留明显的颜料堆积、刮刀痕迹、起伏边缘、纸张纹理和半手工塑形感；厚涂集中在水面、云层、色带与局部高光，让主体既精致立体，又具有真实油彩的物质感。\n\n配色从上方照片中提取**最明亮、最鲜活、最有生命力的颜色**重新调制，而不是平均取色。整体提高明度与色彩纯净度，采用清澈天空蓝、湖水青、嫩绿、暖黄、珊瑚橙、桃粉等由原图自然推导出的明快色相，通过清爽冷暖关系形成治愈感。以大量纯净暖白作为呼吸空间，主色鲜明但不刺眼，局部暖橙、金黄或粉红可作为阳光般的点睛色，使画面具有**晴朗、鲜活、温暖、轻快、有生命力**的色彩精神。避免灰脏、发旧、低沉莫兰迪化、暗褐滤镜、荧光色和廉价糖果感。\n\n文字少量介入，从照片的主体身份、地点、情绪或象征意义中提炼一个简短标题，并搭配极少量副文、编号或微型注释。文字保持细致、克制、留白充足，可沿斜向主轴、主体边缘或大面积空白巧妙排布，像艺术出版物中的精致标注。\n\n整体呈现 **明亮白底、鲜活厚涂、清透色彩、微缩主体、大面积留白与温暖光感** 共同构成的高级治愈气质。无论主体是建筑、人物、动物、植物、器物、交通工具或自然景观，都应保持清晰身份与鲜活色彩，避免灰脏、沉闷、卡通玩具感、塑料CG感、电商感和模板感。\n🪁\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQXrOaFb0AAgHbh.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQXrSePaAAA9ZPO.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQXrT6wa4AANlxa.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQXrVbna4AAm6My.jpg"]},{"i":18930,"text":"Create a premium vertical 4:5 conceptual travel poster of [COUNTRY], designed as a surreal living topographic map.\n\nThe entire country is shaped as a beautifully sculpted 3D landscape, viewed from a slightly elevated angle. Mountains rise naturally from the map, rivers flow through valleys, forests become miniature textured terrain, cities glow subtly, and tiny roads connect important regions.\n\nInstead of placing landmarks separately, seamlessly integrate iconic architecture directly into the geography — a famous monument emerging from a mountain valley, traditional villages nestled beside rivers, tiny markets and people scattered across the landscape.\n\nUse soft pastel earth tones, natural paper textures, delicate shadows, miniature craftsmanship, atmospheric depth, and cinematic morning light.\n\nThe country outline must remain clearly recognizable while feeling like a real miniature world discovered from above.\n\nExtremely clean composition, sophisticated editorial travel design, no flags, no collage, no excessive text.\n\nAdd only the country name in elegant typography at the bottom.\n\nMood: poetic, mysterious, handcrafted, premium, unforgettable.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQYMmSiaEAAm_DW.jpg"]},{"i":18931,"text":"为准确文字【2—4个中文字符／简短英文单词】设计一枚“物字共生”标志，结合器物【物品／工具／乐器／食物／动物】。\n\n首先分析器物最有辨识度的结构：主体轮廓、把手、开口、关节、按钮、底座、尖端、纹理或运动轨迹。\n\n再将这些结构映射到文字笔画中：器物的主体承担主笔画，把手或开口融入字形留白，关节成为转折点，功能性部件成为点、撇、捺或装饰细节。\n\n文字内容、顺序和字数必须完全准确。不要把器物简单放在文字旁边，也不要用插图遮挡文字。最终标志应同时满足：\n\n① 缩小后文字仍然清楚可读\n② 去掉颜色后器物轮廓仍能识别\n③ 字与物形成一个不可拆分的整体\n单一完整标志，居中构图，纯色背景，黑白矢量设计，边缘干净，笔画粗细统一，保留必要负空间。不要海报场景、立体模型、样机、阴影、渐变、复杂纹理和多余文字。\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n这类提示词的关键不是“把什么东西塞进字里”，而是找到二者共用的结构。\n\n例如，镜头可以对应圆形字腔，琴弦可以变成竖向笔画，车架可以承担斜线结构，蒸汽可以延伸为书法收笔。\n\n真正好的融合，不靠解释就能被看懂。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n• 电影片名＋剧情核心道具\n• 餐饮品牌＋代表食材或厨具\n• 音乐栏目＋乐器和声波结构\n• 运动品牌＋球具、跑道或动作轨迹\n• 非遗项目＋传统工具和制作纹样\n• 个人IP名称＋角色标志性配件\n\n⚙️ 参数技巧\n\n先生成纯黑白版本，通过“缩略图测试”后再增加材质和颜色。文字最好控制在2—4个汉字，字越多，融合后越容易失去可读性。\n如果用于正式商标，应人工核对文字、调整矢量节点并进行商标检索；AI生成结果更适合作为创意草案，不宜未经修改直接注册。\n📌 一句话总结\n普通标志让图形陪着文字，物字共生让图形真正长进文字里。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQYi2_-aEAAyNPT.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQYi2_9aoAArjck.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQYi2_7a8AEqAji.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQYi2__bkAAbAqV.jpg"]},{"i":18932,"text":"x VOL.051\n\n从家里盆景得到的灵感启发\n这组提示词，是我今日最爱\n\n建筑变成模型。\n街道变成一条纸上景观。\n人物、植物、交通工具，都能被重新安排进一个小小的立体空间里。\n\n妙哉！\n\n中文版本提示词：\n\n```\n😆😆😆😆\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物和展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，重构为精致的 miniature 3D paper-craft 微缩纸艺场景。不要机械复刻照片，而是将主体及最能强化其身份与环境气质的少量元素，转化为由纸张、卡纸、软陶、木片等材料手工制作的微型模型，自然组织在一条狭长、轻盈的悬浮景观基座上。主体保持一眼可辨，其余元素只作为叙事陪衬，可根据原图加入植物、道路、水面、灯具、交通工具、人物、飞鸟、云朵或其他具有代表性的生活细节，但必须与原始主题真实相关，避免无意义堆砌。\n\n构图以一个核心主体 + 一条横向微缩景观带 + 大面积留白为基础，根据主体的体量、方向与空间关系调整高低、前后、疏密和左右重心，使场景像一件被精心陈列的微型艺术装置。通过尺度变化、层叠遮挡、小型前景与背景元素建立纵深，主体承担主要视觉重量，辅助模型保持更小尺度和更低视觉权重，整体居中但不过度对称，保持轻盈、精致和安静的视觉节奏。\n\n整体继续采用柔和、通透、略微去饱和的高级配色：以浅粉蓝、雾蓝、天空蓝和空气感冷调蓝建立主要氛围，以象牙白、奶油白、浅米色、柔和灰绿、鼠尾草绿和建筑中性色保持平衡，仅使用少量 dusty rose 或 muted blush 作为细节点缀。颜色柔和但干净，避免灰脏、过度泛黄或糖果色，让不同纸层通过轻微色差自然形成空间关系。\n\n材质强调真实手工触感，可见纸纤维、折边、切口、层叠厚度、轻微毛边和细小制作误差；使用柔和自然漫射光与细腻阴影表现微缩模型的真实体积和层次，具有 macro photography 般的近距离质感。背景保持柔和白色或极浅色纸面，大面积干净留白，使整个下半部分像一张被精心拍摄的高级手工旅行明信片。\n\n文字同样融入微缩纸艺语言。从照片的地点、主体身份、主题或情绪中提炼一个简短英文标题，不限定必须是城市名称。标题采用小型、精致、略带手写感的字形，优先放置在景观带下方的留白区域，也可根据主体关系轻微弯曲、沿基座排列或与微缩场景形成空间呼应；保持极少、优雅、克制，不加入大段说明，让文字像作品签名而不是商业标题。\n\n整体呈现 miniature diorama、handcrafted paper art、whimsical 3D illustration、premium travel postcard 的高级视觉气质：轻盈、温柔、精致、可触摸、有生活感，同时保持清晰的设计秩序与大量呼吸空间。无论原图是人物、动物、植物、建筑、器物、交通工具或自然景观，都应保持真实摄影与微缩手工世界之间清晰而巧妙的视觉对应，避免塑料3D、玩具感、儿童手工感、复杂堆积、过度可爱和电商展示感。\n😆😆😆😆\n```\n\nenglish prompt version :\n\n```\n😍😍😍\nPlease transform each photo I upload into a separate, standalone premium-designed poster. Do not create multi-image collages or combine multiple photos into one composition. Each photo must be output individually. Use an overall 3:4 vertical format, divided into two sections with a strict 1:1 height ratio, with the upper and lower sections each occupying exactly 50% of the canvas.\n\nThe upper half should retain the original photograph. Preserve the subject’s structure, realistic texture, natural lighting and shadows, and the original color atmosphere. Apply only subtle, sophisticated photographic color grading to give the image the refined visual quality of an art magazine, independent publication, or exhibition photography. To adapt the photograph to the required aspect ratio, you may naturally extend the sky, ground, or surrounding environment, but do not stretch, distort, reshape, or alter the main subject.\n\nIn the lower half, extract the most recognizable subject, silhouette, pose, and narrative relationship from the photograph, and reinterpret them as a refined miniature 3D paper-craft diorama. Do not mechanically reproduce the photograph. Instead, transform the main subject and a limited number of elements that best reinforce its identity and environmental character into miniature handcrafted models made from materials such as paper, cardstock, soft clay, thin wood pieces, or similar tactile craft materials. Arrange them naturally on a narrow, lightweight, floating landscape base.\n\nThe main subject must remain instantly recognizable at a glance. All other elements should function only as narrative support. Depending on the original photograph, you may incorporate plants, roads, water, lamps, vehicles, people, birds, clouds, or other representative details of everyday life, but every added element must be genuinely relevant to the original theme. Avoid decorative clutter or meaningless accumulation of objects.\n\nBase the composition on one core subject + one horizontal miniature landscape strip + generous negative space. Adjust vertical levels, foreground/background relationships, visual density, and left-right balance according to the subject’s scale, direction, and spatial relationships, so that the scene feels like a carefully curated miniature art installation.\n\nCreate depth through variations in scale, layered overlaps, and small foreground and background elements. The primary subject should carry the greatest visual weight, while supporting models remain smaller and visually quieter. Keep the overall composition centered without making it excessively symmetrical, maintaining a light, refined, calm, and elegant visual rhythm.\n\nContinue using a soft, airy, slightly desaturated premium color palette. Establish the main atmosphere with pale powder blue, mist blue, sky blue, and cool airy blues. Balance these with ivory white, creamy white, light beige, soft gray-green, sage green, and neutral architectural tones. Use only small accents of dusty rose or muted blush for subtle detail.\n\nThe colors should feel soft yet clean. Avoid muddy gray tones, excessive yellow casts, or candy-like colors. Allow different paper layers to create natural spatial separation through subtle variations in tone and color.\n\nEmphasize the authenticity of handcrafted materials. Make paper fibers, folded edges, cut edges, layered thickness, slight fraying, and tiny handmade imperfections visible. Use soft natural diffused lighting and delicate shadows to reveal the real volume, depth, and layering of the miniature models, with the intimate tactile quality of macro photography.\n\nKeep the background soft white or an extremely pale paper tone, with extensive clean negative space, so that the entire lower half feels like a meticulously photographed premium handcrafted travel postcard.\n\nTypography should also be integrated into the visual language of the miniature paper-craft world. Derive a short English title from the location, identity of the subject, theme, or emotional atmosphere of the photograph. The title does not have to be a city name.\n\nUse a small, refined typeface with a subtle handwritten character. Preferably place the title within the negative space below the miniature landscape strip. Depending on the relationship with the subject, the text may also follow a slight curve, align gently along the base, or interact spatially with the miniature scene. Keep the typography minimal, elegant, and restrained. Do not add long descriptive copy. The text should feel more like an artist’s signature than a commercial headline.\n\nThe overall visual direction should combine the premium qualities of miniature diorama, handcrafted paper art, whimsical 3D illustration, and a premium travel postcard. The result should feel light, gentle, refined, tactile, and full of lived-in character, while maintaining strong design discipline and abundant breathing room.\n\nWhether the original photograph features a person, animal, plant, architecture, object, vehicle, or natural landscape, maintain a clear yet clever visual correspondence between the real photographic world in the upper half and the miniature handcrafted world in the lower half.\n\nAvoid plastic-looking 3D rendering, toy-like aesthetics, childish craft styles, overly complicated compositions, excessive cuteness, visual clutter, or an e-commerce product-display appearance.\n😍😍😍\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZqypLaQAATy2x.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZqy2pbIAAsPFB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZq0LXaQAAUf4Z.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZrOzgbUAAbYeC.jpg"]},{"i":18933,"text":"x VOL.001\n\n发明这组提示词的我\n简直不是天才！ 🐕\n\n任何图片，都可以成为包装灵感\n哪怕是你随手一拍，或者搞笑头像 \n\n提示词结尾， 你可以各种输入要求\n比如你的品牌名， 你的一些想法， 你要的包装类型\nGPT-image2会给你惊喜的\n\n完整提示词：\n\n```\n🤠🤠🤠\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、姿态、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，将其转化为一套完整的品牌包装与物料视觉系统。不要简单复制照片，而是把主体特征提炼成可重复使用的核心图形、插画符号、纹样、色块或识别元素，再分别应用到不同尺寸和用途的包装载体中，使所有物料一眼属于同一个视觉家族。\n\n根据原图主题自动选择最合适的 5–8 种载体，例如纸袋、包装盒、套盒、标签、吊牌、票券、卡片、贴纸、封套、杯具包装、钥匙挂件、包装纸或其他相关物料，不强行使用固定品类。以 1–2 个主包装作为视觉重心，其余物料按大小、横竖比例和功能形成模块化组合；使用清晰网格、边缘对齐、尺度反差、间距节奏和大面积留白组织画面，像专业品牌设计工作室的 packaging identity presentation board，而不是商品陈列或杂乱 mockup 拼贴。\n\n配色保持柔和、通透、略微去饱和的高级色系，以浅粉蓝、雾蓝、天空蓝、空气感冷调蓝为主，搭配象牙白、奶油白、浅米色、柔和灰绿和建筑中性色，仅用少量 dusty rose 或 muted blush 作为视觉跳点。不同包装可以改变颜色面积和组合方式，但必须保持同一套色彩系统，形成丰富而统一的系列感。\n\n材质强调真实而精致的纸张与包装工艺，可表现哑光纸、细纹纸、厚卡、半透明纸、压纹、模切、折叠、贴纸、局部印刷与轻微层叠关系；光线柔和自然，只用于表现纸张厚度、折痕和材质差异，避免塑料感、强反光、夸张3D和廉价商品渲染。\n\n文字也作为整个包装系统的一部分统一设计。从原图的主体名称、主题、情绪、功能或象征意义中提炼一个简短英文主标题，并延展出极少量副标题、短句、编号、品类名称或微型说明。文字可以根据不同载体自然变化：竖排于吊牌、沿包装边缘延伸、环绕圆形标签、跨越盒面、隐藏在图形之间或成为包装封口结构的一部分，使字体、图形和材质共同形成完整品牌语言，而不是每件物料重复贴上同一个标题。\n\n整体呈现为一张高级品牌包装系统 / 视觉识别提案板：丰富但不拥挤，活泼但有秩序，既展示完整系列，也能看到图形、文字、材质与不同载体之间的设计逻辑。无论原图是人物、动物、植物、建筑、器物、食物、交通工具或自然景观，都应从原图本身建立独特的包装语言，避免固定产品组合、重复模板、电商展示感和普通品牌 mockup 套版。\n🤠🤠🤠\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZqypLaQAATy2x.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZqy2pbIAAsPFB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZq0LXaQAAUf4Z.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQZrOzgbUAAbYeC.jpg"]},{"i":18934,"text":"to image:\nA horizontal cinematic film strip with 9 panels in one row, showing time progression in a neon city from dusk to dawn.\n\nStyle Consistency:\nLong exposure light trails from cars, skyscrapers with neon lighting, dynamic highway perspective, photorealistic with vibrant colors, 8k resolution.\n\nPanel Sequence:\n1. Dusk: Sky still has orange-pink sunset glow, city lights just turning on, light trails beginning, warm-cool contrast.\n2. Early Evening: Sky deepening to purple, more neon lights active, traffic increasing, light trails longer.\n3. Night Falls: Sky now dark blue, full neon illumination, heavy traffic, intense light trails in white and red.\n4. Deep Night: Pitch black sky, maximum neon intensity, blue and pink dominant, busiest traffic, longest light trails.\n5. Midnight: Darkest point, all lights blazing, dramatic contrast, light trails creating color rivers on highway.\n6. Late Night: Sky slightly lighter, some lights dimming, traffic reducing, light trails shorter but still vibrant.\n7. Pre-dawn: Sky turning deep purple-blue, first hints of dawn, fewer cars, calmer atmosphere.\n8. Dawn Approaching: Sky lightening to orange-pink at horizon, neon lights still on but fading, morning traffic beginning.\n\n9. Sunrise: Bright orange-pink sky, neon lights turning off, morning light replacing artificial glow, new day beginning.\n\nUnified: neon city, time progression, light trails, sky color changes\n\nModel: Seedance 2.5  \n🎥Prompt to video:⤵️","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2091647434732494848/img/2vX_qZx-hRFUK7BT.jpg"]},{"i":18935,"text":"为「[主题]」创作一张3:4竖版单幅视觉。根据经过核实的「[起止年份]」，选取4—6个关键阶段及其代表物件。\n\n俯视平铺构图，所有物件像树木年轮一样排列成清晰的同心圆：\n\n中心放置最早期物件，尺寸较小，带有明显磨损、褪色与旧材质；向外逐圈推进，造型、材料和技术语言依次变化；最外圈代表当代，物件最精密、洁净、现代。\n\n所有物件共同组成「[目标轮廓：眼睛／手机／汽车／品牌首字母]」，缩小观看时仍能辨认整体形状。\n\n博物馆档案式编辑摄影，哑光背景，顶部柔光，真实接触阴影，材质细节丰富，克制而精密。\n\n不要网格、拼贴、分屏、随机堆放、重复物件、年代错序、复杂文字和拥挤的信息图。沿一条径向留出空白，方便后期添加年份。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n时间不一定要靠箭头表达。\n\n用位置表示先后，用磨损表示年代，用材质和造型表示技术变化。观众会经历三次观看：\n\n远看轮廓，中看年轮，近看物件。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n品牌历代产品、相机或手机进化、百年服装变迁、城市交通史、个人成长物件、电影道具演进，都能套用。\n\n⚙️ 关键控制点\n\n控制在4—6个阶段，一圈只表达一次重要变化。真实历史先核对年代和物件，再让AI构图；年份与型号建议后期手动添加，避免模型编造。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n普通时间轴告诉你发生了什么，时间树轮让你看见时间怎样一层层长出来。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdAuvNakAAVMkS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdAuvMbYAAVtL9.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdAuvNaQAAlOBr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdAuvNbIAAWJvT.jpg"]},{"i":18936,"text":"x VOL.055\n\n向往意大利的我\n特别用这种配色和浅浅的油画质感\n打磨出了这套提示词风格\n\n用治愈系颜色和笔触仔细拾掇：\n一束光。\n一个动作。\n一个空间关系。\n\nprompt by xiaoxiaodong:\n\n```\n😍😋\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，延续上下双层逻辑：上半部分为真实摄影，下半部分为基于主体叙事的绘画式重构\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、姿态、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，重构为一幅更具艺术感与版式感的绘画式画面。不要完整描摹照片，也不要再使用贴纸拼贴逻辑，而是只保留最值得被记住的视觉线索，将复杂场景压缩为清晰的主体关系、几组关键块面与安静留白，使人一眼认出原物，同时感受到记忆化、概括化与重新组织后的叙事美感。\n\n整体画风参考温柔、明亮、治愈的粉彩绘画质感：像厚涂水粉、丙烯、粉蜡或带有油画刀痕迹的手工绘画，色块柔软，笔触清楚但不粗重，边缘干净中带少许松动，具有轻微颜料堆积、覆盖与手工触感。避免贴纸感、光滑矢量感、3D塑料感和过度写实。\n\n构图应比普通插画更专业，重视视觉重心、主体落点、留白比例、前后层次、块面节奏、方向引导与版式秩序。主体可适度偏心、放大、裁切或集中于中下部形成明确叙事核心，背景与次要元素主动删减，只保留少量最能支撑氛围的景物、空间线索或环境关系，让画面既有呼吸感，又有明确的主次与阅读路径。\n\n色彩延续你当前喜欢的逻辑：整体采用柔和、通透、略微去饱和的高级色系，可从原图中提炼综合色温进行调整，但整体保持轻盈统一。以浅粉蓝、雾蓝、天空蓝、空气感冷调蓝营造主氛围，再以象牙白、奶油白、浅米色、柔和灰绿、建筑中性色保持平衡；可加入少量 blush pink、soft peach、dusty rose 或 muted blush 作为局部点睛，使画面更有 ins 治愈感、呼吸感与精致层次。避免脏灰、过强反差、高饱和撞色和廉价复古感。\n\n文字不预设固定标题、编号、地点或语种，也不采用菜单式信息。应根据照片的主体、动作、环境、情绪、记忆或文化语境，自由生成极少量真正有意义的字、词、短句或片段，并通过更专业的排版自然融入画面。文字可进入留白、贴近主体、沿视觉轴线排列，或作为边角注记参与构图；整体保持小、轻、克制、精致，像独立出版物中的编辑性文字，而不是商业标题。\n\n整体气质应像一本独立出版的视觉手册或艺术旅行刊物：温柔、明亮、治愈、现代、安静、松弛，同时具有明确的主体叙事与高级排版秩序。 避免贴纸逻辑、完整写实风景、细碎堆积、粗重轮廓、模板化海报感、电商插画感、卡通感和过度装饰。\n😍☺️\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdSDDCbsAA6UsU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdSDDEbsAAM7mL.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdSEo0aMAAF59O.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdSFW3aMAAv7rA.jpg"]},{"i":18937,"text":"x VOL.056\n\n一组魔法级别的提示词\n能把你那些独特的情绪\n变成一幅带有手绘痕迹的视觉记忆。\n\n强调了：\n笔触可以停顿。\n颜色可以偏一点。\n形态可以有一点笨拙。\n\n提示词如下：\n\n```\n😩😰😨😮‍💨\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，延续上下双层逻辑：上半部分为真实摄影，下半部分为对原图核心意象的绘画式提炼，上下形成现实与记忆之间的呼应。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、姿态、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系**，进一步判断原图真正成立的核心主题、视觉隐喻或审美关系，只保留这一层最值得被记住的信息重新创作。不要完整复刻场景，不追求背景还原，也不要把所有物体逐一转换成插画；主动删除无关环境与细碎信息，只留下一个核心主体及极少数真正参与叙事的关系，使画面像一段被重新整理过的视觉记忆。\n\n下半部分以**极度浅色背景和大面积留白**作为主要空间。背景色不固定，根据原图综合色温与情绪智能匹配为接近白色的极浅综合色，可微暖、微冷或带极轻微色相，但必须轻、净、安静。空白本身承担空气、距离、时间和情绪，让主体拥有充分呼吸感。\n\n构图强调**视觉重心、尺度关系、负空间、方向张力与不完全对称**。主体可偏置、局部裁切、悬置或落在低重心区域，通过大小反差和大片留白建立美感。若原图真正动人的是人与空间、物与环境、两个对象之间的距离或某种偶然关系，应优先保留这种关系，而不是单独描绘物体本身。\n\n绘画语言采用松弛、稚拙而具有艺术感的**不透明水粉、丙烯、粉蜡笔与干性油画质感**，以概括色块、手绘轮廓、局部刮擦、覆盖和不完全填满的笔触塑造主体。形体允许略带笨拙和轻微比例夸张，但主体身份与关键姿态必须准确。画面保留真实绘画中的停顿、修改、露底与偶然痕迹，避免精修得过于光滑。\n\n配色从原图提炼综合色温和最具有生命力的颜色，再转译成一种**温暖、明快、略带稚拙感的艺术家色盘**。整体以奶油黄、杏色、粉橘、珊瑚粉、旧玫瑰等温暖色块，与天空蓝、浅青绿、薄荷绿、灰绿等清凉色形成松弛的冷暖碰撞；允许极少量砖红、橙红、深绿、土褐或黑色作为视觉锚点。颜色不必完全服从真实物体，可根据画面节奏进行局部换色、错色和跳色，但必须保持整体和谐。色块应具有粉质、不透明、略微褪色却依然鲜活的感觉，避免莫兰迪式全面降灰、统一粉彩滤镜、脏褐色和高饱和数字色。\n\n文字不预设固定标题、地点、编号或语种，根据原图的主题、动作、环境、情绪、声音、记忆或隐喻自由生成极少量真正有意义的字、词、短句或片段。文字可以像绘画的一部分自然进入留白、靠近主体、沿空间方向展开，甚至保留少量手写、错位或不完全规整的感觉；整体仍保持克制，不为了“像海报”而机械添加信息。\n\n整体追求**极浅背景、巨大留白、少量主体、鲜活而温暖的色彩关系、稚拙手绘感与明确的视觉隐喻**。画面应安静但不寡淡，治愈但不甜腻，艺术但不故作高级，像一本被艺术家亲手画过的独立出版物。避免完整场景复刻、背景填满、物件罗列、统一粉彩滤镜、精致商业插画、光滑矢量、卡通模板和为了丰富而加入无意义元素。\n🥴😵‍💫😓🥱\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdSDDCbsAA6UsU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdSDDEbsAAM7mL.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdSEo0aMAAF59O.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQdSFW3aMAAv7rA.jpg"]},{"i":18938,"text":"to image:\nA unique fantasy campaign scene of a majestic sailing ship drifting calmly across a glassy, reflective sea beneath a pastel sky, reimagined with fresh visual storytelling and an entirely new composition. The sails shimmer with iridescent glow, catching soft atmospheric light as the vessel feels suspended between reality and dream, with a tranquil, magical realism atmosphere that remains serene yet distinctly original.\nEnvironment:\n• Vast open sea with mirror-like reflections, gentle ripples, and a horizon that feels expansive and cinematic\n• Fluffy cloud formations in layered pastel tones, creating depth without clutter\n• Avoid additional ships, landmasses, birds, or distracting objects that break the quiet solitude\nLighting:\n• Soft ethereal daylight with diffused illumination across sails, rigging, and water\n• Subtle rim light on the ship’s silhouette and delicate glow bloom around iridescent surfaces\n• No harsh shadows, no blown highlights, no aggressive contrast\nMaterials:\n• Sails with pearlescent, translucent fabric behavior and luminous color shifts\n• Dark polished wood hull with realistic grain and gentle specular highlights\n• Water with a smooth reflective surface and believable light scatter\nComposition:\n• Wide cinematic framing with the ship placed off-center for a more unique, editorial balance\n• Emphasize negative space in sky and water to heighten the dreamlike stillness\n• Calm horizontal composition with the vessel occupying a strong but elegant share of the frame\nMood:\nSerene, mystical, and quietly otherworldly with a fresh, unique fantasy-cinematic identity\nShot on 85mm lens, f/2.8, shallow depth of field, ultra-detailed, 8K realism\n\n🏞 Prompt to image:\nA majestic sailing ship with iridescent, glowing sails drifts calmly across a glassy, reflective sea under a pastel sky filled with fluffy clouds; the overall composition is serene and dreamlike, with soft, ethereal lighting and a tranquil mood reminiscent of a fantasy or magical realism painting.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQe1-TKXQAAnej1.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQe1UYVXsAApcts.jpg"]},{"i":18939,"text":"to video:\nUse @[Image] as storyboard reference for cinematic sequence. use as first shot 01\nA 10-second majestic cinematic landscape sequence transitioning in one continuous flow. Visual style: photorealistic 8K, ethereal arctic twilight, vibrant aurora borealis, snow-capped mountain reflections, ultra-high detail, premium nature documentary aesthetic. CRITICAL: Absolutely NO frames, borders, film strips, numbers, UI, or text. Render as seamless full-screen cinematic shots only. Ignore any grid layout. Preserve exact color palette, lighting, and textures from the reference.\n\nShot 1 (0-3.5s): Low-angle establishing movement. Gentle waves rhythmically lap against the wet shoreline, perfectly reflecting the vibrant pink, orange, and teal sky. A lone wooden rowboat rests peacefully, bobbing slightly with the water's motion. Camera glides slowly forward over the reflective sand.\n\nShot 2 (3.5-7.0s): Camera smoothly tilts upward, revealing the vast expanse of the calm fjord. The green aurora borealis intensifies, dancing and swirling dynamically across the starry purple sky. The horizon glows with warm golden light, casting shimmering liquid reflections on the water's surface. Snow-capped peaks stand majestically in the distance.\n\nShot 3 (7.0-10.0s): Wide panoramic hold. The camera settles on the full breathtaking vista. The aurora continues its graceful, fluid dance, stars twinkle softly, and the gentle waves create a soothing, rhythmic motion. The atmosphere is serene, expensive, and deeply immersive. Camera slowly pulls back for a majestic finale. ZERO TEXT.\n\nStyle reinforcement: seamless continuous camera movement, photorealistic water and sky simulation, dynamic aurora animation, consistent vibrant color grading, cinematic pacing, NO text, NO grid, NO numbers, ultra-luxury nature aesthetic.\n\n🏞 Prompt to image⤵️","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2091908036252123137/img/I87EMkJG8sw6aIZ_.jpg"]},{"i":18940,"text":"Create a premium vertical 4:5 travel poster for [COUNTRY], illustrated as one elegant continuous hand-drawn line-art composition.\n\nInstead of placing landmarks separately, make them flow organically into one another, as if the entire country was drawn in a single uninterrupted travel sketch. Combine the country’s most recognizable architecture, landscapes, culture, food, transportation, nature, and tiny everyday details into one beautifully balanced scene.\n\nUse bold black ink outlines, delicate cross-hatching, playful imperfect hand-drawn details, subtle vintage-poster typography, and a mostly warm off-white paper background. Add only 2–3 signature accent colors inspired by the country.\n\nInclude:\n\nOne dominant iconic landmark\nA second architectural landmark subtly integrated into the skyline\nA famous natural landscape in the background\nLocal transportation\nTraditional clothing or cultural detail\nA recognizable food or drink\nSmall street-life moments\nBirds, clouds, plants and tiny decorative elements\nHandwritten labels pointing to selected elements\n\nAt the top, use a large playful hand-lettered title:\n\n“[COUNTRY]”\n\nBelow it, add a tiny elegant subtitle:\n\n“A little world to discover”\n\nMake the composition feel collected, whimsical, editorial, nostalgic and handcrafted, like a beautifully illustrated travel journal rather than a generic tourist poster. Avoid photorealism, gradients, 3D rendering and excessive colors. Clean white space around the illustration, highly detailed ink work, charming imperfections, premium stationery aesthetic, screen-print texture, sophisticated yet playful.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQiO-2CaEAA5wNE.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQiO-2IbEAAZBon.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQiO-2LaIAANEDo.jpg"]},{"i":18941,"text":"上传以下视觉资料\n\n图一为品牌标志\n图二为标准色彩\n图三至图五为品牌插画或核心图形\n请提取并严格保持标志结构、色彩比例、插画线条、人物特征与整体视觉气质，为「品牌名称」制作一张宽高比三比四的单幅品牌现场照片。\n场景设定为「快闪店／文化展览商店／新品发布会／咖啡馆／创作者工作室」。\n\n背景设置大型招牌、墙面图形或空间导视。中景展示工作人员服装、产品包装和陈列装置。前景放置手册、纸袋、贴纸、徽章与卡片。\n\n所有物件存在于同一个连续空间，保持统一光线、透视与材质关系。不同载体根据尺寸选择合适的品牌元素，避免把完整标志机械地贴满所有物件。\n\n真实印刷油墨、布料刺绣、磨砂纸张、亚克力招牌与包装折痕，编辑摄影质感，自然的人物使用痕迹，克制而可信。\n\n禁止样机合集、网格分屏、漂浮物件、标志变形、错误配色、重复图案、虚假小字和千篇一律的高奢空间。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n这是一场品牌视觉的三级检验。\n\n远看能否记住色彩与招牌，中距离能否认出图形系统，近看能否相信材料和印刷细节。\n\n好的现场化图像还会给不同元素安排工作。标志负责识别，插画负责叙事，颜色负责连接空间，纹样负责填充小尺寸物件。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n可以用于个人品牌、文化遗产展览、影视项目发布、餐饮空间、图书上市、城市活动、角色IP商店和产品发布会。\n\n⚙️ 关键控制点\n\n一次只放入一个场景和五种左右的应用载体。参考资料控制在一个标志、三至五种颜色、两至四张插画。\n\n先生成无复杂文字的空间版本，再用局部编辑补充品牌名。正式交付前仍需人工核对标准色、标志比例、文字和印刷工艺。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n品牌现场化让一套视觉提前走进现实，在招牌、衣服和纸袋上同时接受检验。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQiYYFNaIAAtM-O.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQiYYFPa4AAi9l7.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQiYYFJbAAAwbnn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQiYYFPbUAAD3wZ.jpg"]},{"i":18942,"text":"x VOL.059\n\nGPT-image2的进步\n确实可圈可点了\n\n让我心动，让各种风格都有可能\n\n有冲动，让自己虚拟角色三视图ip，结合这些提示词来创建各种故事绘本\n\n哪怕只是用来给家里小孩，辅助学习英语都好。\n\n后续这个思路，我要拓展成skills\n\n本组提示词全文如下：\n\n```\n😁🙂😋\n\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，延续上下双层逻辑：上半部分为真实摄影，下半部分为基于核心意象与潜台词的手绘叙事重构\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、姿态、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分不再追求重现场景全貌，而是提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态、空间关系与情绪隐喻，在理解原图潜台词、气氛和寓意之后，重构为一幅带有手绘叙事感的寓言式画面。不要完整描摹照片，也不要机械复制细节，而是只保留最本质、最值得记住的核心图形逻辑，把复杂现实转化为更纯粹、更有象征意味的图像关系，使人一眼认出原物，同时感受到它背后隐藏的情绪、记忆与意味。\n\n下半部分的风格参考你提供的那种温暖纸面上的手绘插画气质：画面带有童真、隐喻、轻微诙谐与即兴感，像一本旅行寓言绘本或私人神话地图。可以对原图进行适度想象与重组，把真实场景中的主体、环境和细节转译为更有叙事性的象征元素；允许把原图的情绪、关系或精神内核，通过夸张比例、拟人意味、隐喻景物、重复符号或天真而聪明的构图方式重新表达，但始终围绕同一个核心主题，不变成拼贴式元素堆积。\n\n构图应建立在大面积淡色背景与清晰主次关系之上，保留充足留白，让空白承担空气、距离、安静和想象空间。主体可集中于中下部或某个更有叙事张力的位置，周围只保留少量支撑性的景物、路径、植物、建筑、器物或象征符号，通过高低错落、远近层次、曲线引导、块面节奏与正负形关系形成更专业、更有美感的版式秩序。画面可以像“从现实中长出一小段幻想”，既有故事感，也有克制的平面设计意识。\n\n整体画风采用手绘感明确的平面插画语言：可表现为不透明水粉、粉彩、彩铅、蜡笔、丙烯或带轻微纸纹的绘本式上色，保留柔和块面、略带笨拙的轮廓、轻微手工误差与自然材料感。线条不必太多，但应有适度手绘痕迹；形体简化、比例可爱、细节概括，既温柔又有趣，避免光滑矢量、3D塑料感、写实精描和过于工整的商业插画感。\n\n配色延续当前逻辑：整体采用柔和、通透、略微去饱和的高级色系，并以淡色背景和大面积留白为基础。以浅粉蓝、雾蓝、天空蓝、空气感冷调蓝营造主氛围，再以象牙白、奶油白、浅米色、柔和灰绿、建筑中性色保持平衡；可加入少量 blush pink、soft peach、dusty rose 或 muted blush 作为局部点睛，使画面更有 ins 治愈感、呼吸感与精致层次。避免脏灰、过强反差、高饱和撞色和廉价复古感。\n\n文字不预设固定标题、编号、地点或语种，也不做菜单式信息。应根据照片的主体、情绪、动作、记忆或隐喻，自由生成极少量真正有意义的字、词、短句或片段，并通过高级编辑排版自然融入留白区域。文字应小、轻、克制、精致，像独立出版物中的诗性注记或聪明旁白，与画面形成若有若无的呼应，而不是直白解释画面。\n\n整体气质应像一本独立出版的艺术旅行绘本或寓言式视觉手册：淡色、留白、温暖、童真、聪明、安静、诙谐、带隐喻与即兴感，同时具有清晰的核心主题和高级版式秩序。 避免完整写实风景、信息堆积、主体过满、背景过实、模板化海报感、电商插画感、卡通套路、过度装饰和无意义的可爱化处理。\n\n🥲😜🥰\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjyIy_agAEBio7.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjyJrEaMAAz98g.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjyNr1asAA9oba.jpg"]},{"i":18943,"text":"Continued:\n\n  \"rendering_notes\": {\n    \"medium_simulation\": \"oil pastel / wax crayon on smooth surface (texture of the stroke itself, not the background)\",\n    \"consistency\": \"stroke thickness and scribble density should be consistent with the reference style — moderately dense, not sparse single-line sketch, not fully solid flat fill either\",\n    \"lighting\": \"flat, even, no dramatic lighting or shading applied to the sketch or background\",\n    \"composition_note\": \"since canvas is 3:4 portrait, the logo remains dead-center in the middle of the frame with extra empty white space distributed evenly above and below it, not stretched or resized to fill the full height\"\n  },\n\n  \"user_input_required\": {\n    \"company_name_or_logo\": \"{{COMPANY_NAME}} or uploaded logo image\",\n    \"brand_colors\": \"auto-detect from {{COMPANY_NAME}}'s official brand guidelines, or extract dominant colors from the uploaded logo if provided\"\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjvgH7aUAAPcl6.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjvgIBaQAAwYiP.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjvgICagAAaz6E.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjvgIMbAAAWfwv.jpg"]},{"i":18944,"text":"Nostalgic crayon-style brand logo that feels warm, human, and instantly memorable.\n\n[ Logo Series - Part 3 ]\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"prompt_name\": \"Crayon Sketch Logo Reveal Template\",\n  \"instructions_for_use\": \"Replace {{COMPANY_NAME}} with the brand name, or attach the uploaded logo file as a reference image and instruct the model to use its exact silhouette/wordmark shape. Replace {{BRAND_PRIMARY_COLOR}} and {{BRAND_SECONDARY_COLOR}} with that brand's official color hex codes. Nothing else in this prompt should be changed.\",\n\n  \"canvas\": {\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"3:4\",\n    \"resolution\": \"1536x2048\",\n    \"orientation\": \"vertical portrait\"\n  },\n\n  \"background\": {\n    \"color\": \"#FFFFFF\",\n    \"description\": \"Pure flat solid white background, completely clean and uniform. No paper grain, no cream tone, no texture, no vignette, no shadows on the background itself. Must render as true white #FFFFFF edge to edge.\",\n    \"texture\": \"none\"\n  },\n\n  \"main_subject\": {\n    \"type\": \"hand-drawn crayon / oil-pastel sketch interpretation of a brand logo\",\n    \"content\": \"A loose, expressive, hand-sketched recreation of the {{COMPANY_NAME}} logo (wordmark and/or icon exactly as the real brand logo appears), rendered entirely in thick waxy crayon/oil pastel strokes\",\n    \"placement\": \"perfectly centered both horizontally and vertically on the canvas, occupying roughly 60%-75% of the canvas width, with balanced equal white space margins on all four sides\",\n    \"line_and_stroke_style\": [\n      \"thick, waxy, semi-transparent crayon strokes layered on top of each other\",\n      \"visible directional hatching/scribble strokes filling in solid shapes (not flat vector fill)\",\n      \"uneven, imperfect hand-drawn outlines with slightly wobbly, organic edges — not geometrically perfect\",\n      \"visible tiny white gaps/specks inside filled areas where crayon didn't fully cover (broken coverage look)\",\n      \"occasional overlapping double-strokes where the hand appears to have gone over an edge twice\",\n      \"small scattered flecks, dots, and light splatter marks of the same pigment scattered loosely around the main shape, mimicking dry pastel dust/crumbs\",\n      \"a few faint, barely-visible construction/guide strokes near the top of the drawing, as if lightly sketched before the final strokes\",\n      \"strokes sit flat on the white background with no drop shadow\"\n    ],\n    \"color_rule\": \"Use ONLY the official brand colors of {{COMPANY_NAME}} (primary color {{BRAND_PRIMARY_COLOR}} and secondary color {{BRAND_SECONDARY_COLOR}} if the logo has more than one color). Do not invent new colors. If the logo is monochrome (black/white), render the sketch in a single dark charcoal/black crayon tone instead of full color.\",\n    \"accuracy_rule\": \"The overall shape, proportions, and letterforms must be clearly recognizable as the real {{COMPANY_NAME}} logo, just filtered through a loose hand-drawn crayon texture — not abstracted beyond recognition.\"\n  },\n\n  \"elements_to_exclude\": [\n    \"NO text anywhere on the canvas — no handle/username, no style badge, no watermark icon, no captions, nothing in the top-left, top-right, bottom-left, or bottom-right corners\",\n    \"NO logo icon overlays, NO UI chrome, NO badges, NO pills, NO small circular avatars\",\n    \"DO NOT include the circular badge showing the clean/official vector version of the logo — it must be completely removed\",\n    \"no cream, beige, or textured paper background — must be pure #FFFFFF\",\n    \"no photorealistic rendering, no 3D, no gradients on the crayon strokes themselves\",\n    \"no drop shadows cast onto the white background by the sketch\",\n    \"the canvas must contain ONLY the crayon-sketch logo artwork and nothing else — a completely clean empty white field around it\"\n  ],\n\n  \"overall_mood\": \"playful, artisanal, nostalgic 'kid-with-a-crayon' recreation of a polished corporate logo, isolated on a crisp clean minimal white canvas with zero UI or text distractions\",","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjxOJSbQAAfDG6.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjxOJRbcAEy2sy.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjxOJQbwAAw-WQ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjxOJQa8AA3y1u.jpg"]},{"i":18945,"text":"Continued:\n\n  \"rendering_notes\": {\n    \"medium_simulation\": \"oil pastel / wax crayon on smooth surface (texture of the stroke itself, not the background)\",\n    \"consistency\": \"stroke thickness and scribble density should be consistent with the reference style — moderately dense, not sparse single-line sketch, not fully solid flat fill either\",\n    \"lighting\": \"flat, even, no dramatic lighting or shading applied to the sketch or background\",\n    \"composition_note\": \"since canvas is 3:4 portrait, the logo remains dead-center in the middle of the frame with extra empty white space distributed evenly above and below it, not stretched or resized to fill the full height\"\n  },\n\n  \"user_input_required\": {\n    \"company_name_or_logo\": \"{{COMPANY_NAME}} or uploaded logo image\",\n    \"brand_colors\": \"auto-detect from {{COMPANY_NAME}}'s official brand guidelines, or extract dominant colors from the uploaded logo if provided\"\n  }\n}\n\nNo wordmark please. Only logo","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjxQayaEAAl0T8.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjxQa1bQAAmBQt.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjxQa7acAAT5ny.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQjxQbKa0AA0kkH.jpg"]},{"i":18946,"text":"to image 1:\nA serene and realistic painting of a white swan gracefully gliding on a calm pond, surrounded by tall green reeds and lily pads. The water reflects the swan and the blue sky above, which is dotted with soft, fluffy clouds. The composition centers the swan, creating a peaceful and tranquil mood, with lush greenery and distant trees completing the natural landscape. The brushwork is detailed and the colors are soft and natural, evoking a sense of calm and beauty in nature.\n\n🏞 Prompt to image 2:\nA charming painting of a relaxed otter floating on its back in a tranquil pond surrounded by blooming white water lilies and green lily pads, with tall reeds framing the scene on both sides. The water reflects the blue sky and fluffy white clouds above, while a lush, green landscape stretches into the distance, creating a peaceful and idyllic mood. The brushstrokes are expressive, adding texture and vibrancy to the natural setting.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQoRM_IW0AAfK3_.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQoRPWjXwAAzkNK.jpg"]},{"i":18947,"text":"为「主题」创作一张宽高比三比四的单幅票根立景海报。\n\n前景出现一只真实的人手，在画面左下方轻轻捏住一张竖向的「车票／展览门票／电影票／演出票」。票面采用真实纸张、旧油墨与轻微折痕，只保留「地点、事件名称、年份」三项准确文字。\n\n一座与票面主题有关的微缩世界从票根背后真实展开。\n\n核心地标位于最高处，承担第一视觉焦点。中层设置具有地域特征的建筑、街道与交通工具。底层加入当地食物、植物、行人动作或活动道具。\n\n所有景物通过纸张切口、折叠支架与层叠结构连接票根，能够看见纸边、接缝、厚度、遮挡关系与投射阴影。禁止让建筑无缘无故悬浮。\n\n周围留出暖象牙白纸面，点缀少量手绘地图、旅行路线、建筑速写、邮戳与手写短句。真实纸纤维、木材、石膏与微缩模型材质，四分之三俯视角，温暖自然棚拍光，高级旅行杂志与收藏级纪念品摄影质感。\n\n禁止拼贴、分屏、地标大杂烩、错误建筑、虚假小字、重复建筑、塑料玩具感和巨大标题。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n票根负责建立记忆入口，立体景物负责补全当时的空间。\n\n画面只需三个识别证据。一个核心地标，一种街头生活，一种自然或地域环境。数量过多，城市会变成景点清单。\n\n真正决定可信度的是连接处。建筑必须从票根的折缝中升起，街道要沿纸面向外延伸，人物和车辆也要留下符合比例的接触阴影。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n演唱会门票可以长出舞台，博物馆门票可以展开文物，电影票可以升起经典场景，婚礼请柬可以变成共同记忆，返乡车票也能长出一条熟悉的老街。\n\n⚙️ 关键控制点\n\n真实地点先核对地标、建筑年代、交通工具与植物。票面文字控制在三项以内，复杂日期和编号后期添加。\n\n一张图只安排一个主地标与两至四个辅助元素。视角保持在四分之三俯视，才能同时看清票面、折叠结构和城市纵深。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n票根证明你曾经来过，立景让那段经历重新从纸上长出来。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQo0zfxacAAjMCl.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQo0zfwagAAmQSL.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQo0zfwawAA9wg-.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQo0zfwbcAAuHTJ.jpg"]},{"i":18948,"text":"A vibrant colored-pencil illustration in portrait orientation. In the foreground, a small bright yellow goldfinch with an orange beak and subtle black wing markings perches on a curved bent stalk of green wheat, its feathers damp with tiny clinging water droplets, head slightly turned. It is surrounded by a lush, dense field of white daisies with bright sunny-yellow to golden textured centers, interwoven with green wheat stalks and tall grasses, some daisies slightly angled or partially obscured. The greenery is rendered in deep, rich tones — emerald, forest green and deep vivid greens — providing strong contrast to the crisp white petals. Large, prominent, glass-like teardrop-shaped water droplets hang suspended throughout the air at varying depths, refracting the light, together with droplets clinging to the petals and leaves. A soft summer rain falls in visible diagonal streaks of water. At the top center, a brilliant glowing sun breaks through soft textured clouds in shades of grey-white, casting luminous golden \"god rays\" and a warm lens-flare effect that filters down through the droplets across the whole field. In the far distance past the swaying daisies and wheat, a couple stands hand in hand as dark, soft blue-grey silhouettes, tiny and peaceful against the glowing sky and gentle haze at the horizon. The palette is dominated by rich, deep greens (from forest green to bright emerald and lime), crisp white, vibrant sunny yellow, and warm golden light, with cool, transparent, reflective droplets, accented by a slightly moody, atmospheric sky. The composition is dense, immersive and eye-level, with large detailed daisies and wheat in the foreground receding into a soft, sunlit distance. The style is reminiscent of colored pencil art, with visible textures and soft blending creating a fresh, lush, slightly dramatic mood. The overall atmosphere is bright yet deep, peaceful and slightly magical, capturing a fleeting moment where sunlight and rain coexist.\n\n🏞 Prompt:\nA vibrant colored-pencil illustration in portrait orientation. A lush field of white daisies with bright sunny-yellow centers fills the foreground and mid-ground, with delicate white petals covered in glistening water droplets, some petals slightly drooping under the weight of the rain. Large, clear, teardrop-shaped water droplets hang suspended in the air throughout the scene, refracting the light like tiny lenses and adding a sense of motion and atmosphere. A soft summer rain falls in visible diagonal streaks of water. The background is a deep, vibrant green of grass and foliage. At the top center, a bright, glowing light source breaks through the soft clouds and casts luminous golden \"god rays\" that filter down through the rain, giving the entire scene a warm, golden-green glow. The palette is dominated by rich greens (from deep forest green to bright lime), crisp white, and sunny yellow, accented by cool, transparent reflective droplets. The composition is dense and immersive, with larger detailed daisies in the foreground and smaller, softer ones receding into the distance. The style is reminiscent of colored pencil art, with visible textures creating a soft, fresh, rejuvenating mood. The overall atmosphere is bright, refreshing, and slightly surreal, capturing a fleeting moment where sunlight and rain coexist.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQo3CaIXEAAojfS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQo23NDWUAAr3Dm.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HQo0jX8XAAAc7lC.jpg"]},{"i":18949,"text":"分享:\n30秒，采用世界顶级高级餐饮电影、Chef’s Table、米其林盐壳料理、Tableside Reveal、高端香水封香概念与高级晶体微距摄影语言，表现传统客家盐焗鸡。主角为完整鸡只，以沙姜盐调味，用耐热白纸完整包裹，再埋入大量炒热粗粒盐中慢火焗熟。最终鸡皮自然淡金黄、鸡肉嫩滑多汁。\n \n0–4秒巨大纯白极简空间，100mm超微距拍真实粗海盐晶体，半透明、不规则、有细小折射，数颗盐晶落在白色石面，字幕“盐 / SALT”“不是调味 / MORE THAN SEASONING”。\n \n4–8秒沙姜被磨成米黄色细粉，与盐混合，厨师只露手，将沙姜盐均匀擦过晾干鸡体表面，字幕“香 / AROMA”“先藏进去 / LOCK IT WITHIN”。\n \n8–12秒象牙白耐热纸铺开，完整鸡放在中央，俯拍厨师双手依次折叠纸张，将鸡完全包裹成干净白色包裹，字幕巨大“封 / SEALED”。\n \n12–17秒厚壁锅底铺厚层粗盐，纸包鸡置于中央，大量真实粗盐从上方高帧率缓慢落下，像白色矿物颗粒，逐渐完全埋住纸包，字幕“藏 / BURIED”“把香交给热 / LET HEAT DO THE REST”。\n \n17–21秒镜头始终停留在厚盐层表面，不看鸡。超微距表现盐晶一侧逐渐受到暖光影响，少量真实热气从盐粒间上升，视觉从冷白逐渐过渡到暖金，字幕“焗 / HEAT, HELD WITHIN”。\n \n21–25秒高级餐厅暖白石桌，厨师用银色小铲缓慢拨开盐层，大量盐晶向两侧滑落，逐渐露出纸包，并将纸包从盐中取出，不显示字幕，突出盐晶与纸张真实声音。\n \n25–28秒包裹放在浅色石面，厨师缓慢打开多层纸张，最后一层掀开时大量真实温热蒸汽自然释放，逆光穿过蒸汽，随后露出完整盐焗鸡。鸡皮自然淡金、姜黄、暖琥珀色，润泽但不红亮。100mm微距表现鸡皮纹理、嫩肉与少量天然鸡汁。字幕“启 / REVEALED”“香气终于有了出口 / THE AROMA ESCAPES”。\n \n28–30秒双手轻轻撕开鸡腿与主体，内部白嫩鸡肉自然分开，肉纤维细嫩，有少量肉汁与蒸汽，一小块鸡肉被轻轻撕下，突然切暖白。最终字幕“客家盐焗鸡 / HAKKA SALT-BAKED CHICKEN”“千盐封香，一启见鲜 / SEALED IN SALT. REVEALED IN FLAVOR.”“食色 / EDIBLE LUXURY”。最后听见两颗粗盐落在桌面的清脆声音。\n \n不要烧鸡红亮皮色，不要酱油色，不要大火烧烤，不要普通酒楼摆盘，不要鸡埋在盐里裸焗，必须先纸包，不要大厨露脸，不要古装，不要传统民乐，不要吃播，不要Logo。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2092833459345723392/img/L7sw-ZCGzHb7QZkb.jpg"]},{"i":18950,"text":"为【饮料／咖啡／果汁／鸡尾酒】创作一张宽高比三比四的单幅商业广告照片。\n\n摄影机真实放置在透明玻璃杯内部、靠近杯底的位置，使用十四毫米超广角微距镜头垂直向上拍摄。画面四周必须能够看见弧形杯壁、杯底边缘、水珠与玻璃折射，明确证明镜头位于杯中，而不是从杯外拍摄。\n\n画面上方，一只手将【产品瓶／咖啡壶／饮料罐】伸向杯口，正把液体倒入杯中。人物面部出现在圆形杯口之外，微微俯身看向杯底，与镜头形成直接视线关系。\n\n液体沿杯壁向下流动，冰块、气泡与【柠檬片／咖啡液／薄荷叶／珍珠】从镜头周围掠过；中央保留清晰视野，不能被液体完全遮住。\n\n高速闪光摄影，冻结飞溅瞬间，真实玻璃折射、液体表面张力、冰块透光与冷凝水珠。色彩清爽浓郁，高级饮品广告质感。\n\n不要外部平视机位、普通俯拍、完整淹没镜头、错误重力、悬浮液体、重复手指、浑浊玻璃、虚假包装文字和塑料三维渲染感。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n这个玩法的重点不是“加一个鱼眼效果”，而是建立三层空间证据：\n\n杯壁形成前景，液体制造事件，杯外人物完成关系。\n\n观众必须一眼感觉到：自己不是在看一杯饮料，而是正在杯中等待它落下来。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n• 奶茶珍珠像陨石一样落向镜头\n• 咖啡与牛奶在杯内形成大理石纹旋涡\n• 香槟气泡包围镜头，杯外人物正在碰杯\n• 从透明食品罐内部拍摄原料倾倒\n• 从快递箱内部仰拍产品开箱瞬间\n• 将画面继续生成五秒液体冲向镜头的视频\n\n⚙️ 关键控制点\n\n镜头距杯底保持两至四厘米，仰拍角度接近九十度。杯口、杯壁和杯外人物必须同时出现，否则容易退化成普通饮品特写。\n\n选择透明或半透明液体；第一帧最好停在液体即将覆盖镜头之前，既保留空间信息，也方便继续制作飞溅视频。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n过去我们从杯外拍饮料，杯中机位让观众亲自掉进味道里。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQtATEYaIAAEPzQ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQtAYA9aMAAhXCC.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQtAYA-akAAx0d4.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQtAYA8bMAAY6Tq.jpg"]},{"i":18951,"text":"with Gemini Omni 1.1 \n\nThe Island of tides\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"prompt\": \"Create a visually rich, prestige 10-second, 16:9 opening-title sequence for a historical drama titled THE ISLAND OF TIDES, set in the ancient Andaman and Nicobar Islands. The story follows an island community shaped by monsoon cycles, coastal travel, fishing grounds, forest resources, kinship, ritual traditions and growing tensions between neighboring settlements. The sequence must communicate an ancient maritime civilization through environment, materials, weather, craftsmanship and human presence rather than conventional battle scenes or fantasy spectacle. The overall aesthetic should feel historically grounded, cinematic, tactile, mysterious and extraordinarily expensive, like the opening of an award-winning Hollywood historical drama.\",\n\n  \"VISUAL_LANGUAGE\": {\n    \"core_aesthetic\": \"Hyper-realistic historical cinematography, natural tropical humidity, dramatic sunlight and shadow, physically accurate materials, subtle atmospheric haze, monumental compositions, restrained camera movement, sophisticated production design and premium theatrical image quality.\",\n    \"materials_and_palette\": [\n      \"weathered tropical hardwood\",\n      \"pale coral and limestone\",\n      \"dark volcanic and rain-polished stone\",\n      \"polished shell\",\n      \"mother-of-pearl\",\n      \"woven plant fiber\",\n      \"bamboo\",\n      \"charred wood\",\n      \"natural rope and netting\",\n      \"deep monsoon green\",\n      \"turquoise coastal water\",\n      \"storm-blue shadows\",\n      \"wet black surfaces\",\n      \"warm amber firelight\",\n      \"muted mineral earth tones\"\n    ],\n    \"environmental_details\": [\n      \"dense coastal rainforest\",\n      \"tidal creeks\",\n      \"mangrove margins\",\n      \"rain-soaked shoreline\",\n      \"beach ridges shaped by monsoon water\",\n      \"simple timber, bamboo and plant-fiber structures appropriate to an island setting\",\n      \"canoe forms appropriate to ancient island maritime life\",\n      \"woven fishing nets and traps\",\n      \"shell ornaments\",\n      \"natural marine materials\",\n      \"driftwood fire\",\n      \"rain-darkened stone\",\n      \"moving shadows beneath a dense tropical canopy\",\n      \"distant open sea disappearing into monsoon haze\"\n    ],\n    \"historical_accuracy\": [\n      \"Base clothing, tools, architecture, ornaments, boats and environmental details on plausible ancient Andaman and Nicobar Island lifeways.\",\n      \"Do not introduce Maya, Aztec, Incan, Egyptian, Roman, Greek, medieval European, Polynesian, East Asian or other unrelated cultural motifs.\",\n      \"Do not use fantasy crowns, European armor, monumental temples, fictional royal costumes, elaborate palace interiors or stereotypical invented tribal imagery.\",\n      \"Avoid assigning archaeological features to the islands that are not historically supported.\",\n      \"Do not depict invented ancient writing, decorative glyphs, fake inscriptions or pseudo-script.\",\n      \"All visible text must be modern English and must remain perfectly flat, sharp, correctly spelled and readable.\",\n      \"The opening should feel connected to sea, forest, rain, stone, shell, wood and island geography.\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"CAMERA_AND_CINEMATOGRAPHY\": {\n    \"format\": \"16:9 widescreen cinematic composition\",\n    \"look\": \"Premium theatrical historical-drama photography with realistic skin and material response, volumetric tropical light, subtle anamorphic character without excessive lens distortion and extremely controlled highlights.\",\n    \"movement\": \"Slow, deliberate camera movement. No shaky camera, no rapid montage, no music-video editing and no action-trailer cutting.\",\n    \"focus\": \"Use shallow depth of field for tactile details and deep environmental focus for the final title reveal.\",\n    \"lighting\": \"Natural dawn sunlight, reflected water light, humid forest diffusion and practical firelight. Avoid modern studio-looking lighting.\"\n  },\n\n  \"TIMELINE\": {\n    \"0-2.5s\": {\n      \"visual\": \"Before sunrise, the frame begins nearly black. A narrow blade of warm dawn sunlight gradually travels across rain-wet dark stone beside a tidal channel. Fine natural grooves, water marks and shallow lines in the stone visually suggest ancient routes, streams, shoreline movement and canoe passages without becoming a literal fantasy map. Tiny droplets vibrate from distant environmental sounds. A faint trail of reddish mineral earth follows a waterline and gradually leads the eye toward the credit.\",\n      \"text\": \"A SERIES BY ARJUN MENON\",\n      \"text_behavior\": \"The credit emerges cleanly from the illuminated mineral surface and remains completely still and legible. No decorative symbols, no invented script, no glowing text effects. Hold the credit clearly for a readable beat.\",\n      \"transition\": \"The sunlight slips away as the frame transitions through darkness and woven texture.\"\n    },\n\n    \"2.5-5s\": {\n      \"visual\": \"Several small polished shell pieces, dark natural beads, pale marine stones and fragments of mother-of-pearl slide slowly across tightly woven plant fiber. The pieces move with gravity and realistic friction, then precisely lock into a simple circular coastal ornament. The design remains culturally restrained and materially believable rather than ornate fantasy jewelry. The ornament stops moving completely.\",\n      \"text\": \"STARRING ANANYA NAIR\",\n      \"text_behavior\": \"Once the ornament is completely still, the empty center becomes a dark negative space and clean monumental serif lettering appears within it. The actor name is flat, centered, crisp and readable. No glow, no animated glyphs and no decorative lettering.\",\n      \"transition\": \"The circular ornament dissolves into a dark reflective surface.\"\n    },\n\n    \"5-7.5s\": {\n      \"visual\": \"A rain-polished black stone surface catches the flicker of a small wood fire. In the reflection, only a partial silhouette of a coastal leader is visible: restrained woven materials, natural adornment and historically plausible feather details, with no fantasy crown or ceremonial armor. Condensation slowly retreats from the reflective surface, revealing the dark center.\",\n      \"text\": \"CREATED BY RAHUL SEN\",\n      \"text_behavior\": \"The credit appears only inside the clean dark reflection. Monumental serif capitals, flat and extremely readable. Keep the surrounding reflection uncluttered so the name feels integrated into the physical world.\",\n      \"transition\": \"The reflected fire dims as an enormous moving shadow begins crossing the environment.\"\n    },\n\n    \"7.5-8.5s\": {\n      \"visual\": \"NO TEXT. A small physical model-like arrangement of shoreline stone, woven channels, timber markers and canoe pathways sits on wet ground near the forest edge. An approaching storm shadow slowly covers it. Reflected daylight collapses across the surface. Water in the shallow channels withdraws and darkens. The sky above becomes nearly black. One polished green-black bead rolls naturally into the last surviving patch of light.\",\n      \"emotional_effect\": \"This should feel like an elemental warning rather than an action scene.\"\n    },\n\n    \"8.5-10s\": {\n      \"visual\": \"The bead stops at the edge of darkness. Its surface catches a powerful green reflection and it visually transforms into a brilliant emerald point surrounded by deep black wet stone. Pale mineral-colored letterforms rise subtly from the darkness around it, creating the final title.\",\n      \"text\": \"THE ISLAND OF TIDES\",\n      \"text_behavior\": \"The title appears as monumental serif capitals with carved-stone-inspired geometry, but never imitates an ancient script. A single restrained gold-green light sweep travels once across the letters. The light immediately disappears. The title then remains completely still through the final frame.\",\n      \"ending\": \"Hold the final composition in absolute visual stillness for the last beat.\"\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"TYPOGRAPHY\": {\n    \"style\": \"Monumental serif typography inspired by the geometry of carved stone, with elegant proportions, sharp terminals, moderate tracking and premium historical-drama restraint.\",\n    \"behavior\": \"Flat, clean, correctly spelled, perfectly legible English lettering only.\",\n    \"prohibited\": [\n      \"invented glyphs\",\n      \"pseudo-ancient writing\",\n      \"Maya-style glyph imitation\",\n      \"glowing fantasy typography\",\n      \"distorted letters\",\n      \"warped text\",\n      \"ornamental calligraphy\",\n      \"illegible texture overlays\"\n    ],\n    \"visible_text_only\": [\n      \"A SERIES BY ARJUN MENON\",\n      \"STARRING ANANYA NAIR\",\n      \"CREATED BY RAHUL SEN\",\n      \"THE ISLAND OF TIDES\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"SOUND_DESIGN\": {\n    \"creative_direction\": \"Earth-shattering, award-winning cinematic sound design at the level of a world-class Hollywood supervising sound designer. The mix must combine microscopic tactile realism with gigantic elemental scale. Every sound should feel physically recorded, emotionally motivated and spatially immersive. The audience should feel the island through vibration, pressure, distance, moisture and resonance rather than simply hearing a soundtrack.\",\n    \"overall_character\": \"Primordial, colossal, humid, mysterious, intimate and terrifyingly physical. The sound should suggest that the island itself is ancient, alive and immense.\",\n    \"dynamic_arc\": {\n      \"0-2.5s\": [\n        \"Begin near silence with distant rainforest insects, soft canopy movement, humid air and extremely faint tidal water.\",\n        \"Add close, beautifully recorded droplets striking wet stone.\",\n        \"Introduce a deep subterranean rumble that feels geological and oceanic rather than synthetic.\",\n        \"As sunlight crosses the stone, layer distant low-frequency pressure resembling enormous underwater caverns and moving earth.\",\n        \"Keep the environmental details extraordinarily clear while preserving vast headroom.\"\n      ],\n      \"2.5-5s\": [\n        \"Give each shell, bead, stone and fiber contact a hyper-realistic macro sound.\",\n        \"Use tiny clicks, scrapes, granular movement and resonant shell tones recorded in intimate close perspective.\",\n        \"Underneath these microscopic details, slowly build a huge low-frequency oceanic bed.\",\n        \"When the circular ornament locks into place, deliver one devastatingly deep but natural impact created from layered wood, stone, shell and sub-frequency resonance.\",\n        \"Immediately after the impact, create a short vacuum of silence so the credit reveal feels powerful.\"\n      ],\n      \"5-7.5s\": [\n        \"Make the fire sound incredibly intimate: tiny combustion pops, resin crackle, wood strain, hot air movement and subtle smoke turbulence.\",\n        \"Let the black reflective stone carry a deep resonant body, as though it were part of a cavern or enormous rock chamber.\",\n        \"As condensation clears, slowly introduce distant storm pressure and low ocean resonance.\",\n        \"The appearance of the creator credit should receive a controlled sonic bloom rather than a conventional trailer hit.\",\n        \"The bloom must feel massive enough for a large cinema system while remaining organic.\"\n      ],\n      \"7.5-8.5s\": [\n        \"Expand the sound field dramatically as the storm shadow arrives.\",\n        \"Layer distant thunder, broad tidal movement, heavy wind through forest canopy, wet foliage, low atmospheric pressure and deep earth resonance.\",\n        \"The storm should feel larger than the visible frame, extending far beyond the image.\",\n        \"At the exact point when the shadow consumes the final patch of light, abruptly subtract most of the sonic information.\",\n        \"Leave one restrained, ancient conch-like maritime tone suspended in enormous space.\"\n      ],\n      \"8.5-10s\": [\n        \"Give the rolling bead highly detailed close-miked movement: tiny impacts, granular friction, subtle vibration and resonance.\",\n        \"As THE ISLAND OF TIDES appears, allow a monumental sonic rise to emerge from natural materials: resonant stone, shell harmonics, deep ocean movement, distant thunder and low wooden resonance.\",\n        \"The final sonic event must be earth-shattering in cinema playback, with powerful sub-bass pressure and enormous spatial width, but it must never sound like a generic Hollywood trailer boom.\",\n        \"Peak at the exact moment the green light completes its single movement across the title.\",\n        \"Then cut nearly all sound away.\",\n        \"End on a breath of distant sea and barely perceptible environmental air while the title remains still.\"\n      ]\n    },\n\n    \"signature_sound_elements\": {\n      \"geological_low_end\": \"A profound, controlled sub-frequency layer representing ancient rock, deep ocean chambers and the physical mass of the island.\",\n      \"oceanic_scale\": \"Low tidal surges, distant surf, underwater resonance and enormous natural reflections extending beyond the screen.\",\n      \"storm_power\": \"Realistic thunder with very long decay, broad stereo or immersive movement and physical low-frequency pressure.\",\n      \"material_realism\": \"Shell, stone, wood, bamboo, fiber, rain, beads and fire recorded and designed with extreme macro detail.\",\n      \"ancient_resonance\": \"Organic tonal material derived from wood, shell, stone, breath, bamboo-like resonance and natural environmental vibration.\",\n      \"silence\": \"Strategic near-silence after major sonic peaks to create contrast and emotional shock.\"\n    },\n\n    \"mixing\": {\n      \"format\": \"Premium immersive theatrical cinema mix with exceptional spatial depth and controlled low-frequency extension.\",\n      \"spatial_behavior\": \"Rain and insects should surround the audience; beads and stone should feel extremely close; ocean and thunder should exist far beyond the screen; the final sonic swell should expand from intimate detail into an enormous three-dimensional environmental event.\",\n      \"dynamic_range\": \"Very high dynamic contrast between whisper-level environmental detail and colossal natural peaks.\",\n      \"transients\": \"Extremely precise tactile transients with natural resonance and no clipped or crushed impact sounds.\",\n      \"reverb\": \"Use believable acoustic spaces such as wet rainforest, shoreline, rock shelter and open sea. Avoid generic synthetic cinematic reverb.\",\n      \"sub_bass\": \"Deep, powerful and physical, but controlled enough to preserve clarity, dialogue space and theatrical headroom.\"\n    },\n\n    \"award_level_constraints\": [\n      \"No generic cinematic boom samples.\",\n      \"No superhero impacts.\",\n      \"No EDM drops.\",\n      \"No modern drum-kit trailer rhythms.\",\n      \"No fantasy choir.\",\n      \"No generic chanting.\",\n      \"No synthetic science-fiction effects.\",\n      \"No modern orchestral trailer clichés.\",\n      \"No modern musical instruments.\",\n      \"No exaggerated horror stingers.\",\n      \"No continuous wall of sound.\",\n      \"No artificial bass distortion.\",\n      \"Every major sound should originate from, or be convincingly derived from, natural materials and forces such as stone, wood, shell, water, wind, fire, breath and thunder.\"\n    ],\n\n    \"target_feeling\": \"The audience should physically feel an ancient island world awakening around them: rain striking stone close to the ear, distant sea stretching beyond the horizon, storm pressure approaching from miles away, and the final title arriving with the force of something primordial and monumental.\"\n  },\n\n  \"EDITING\": {\n    \"pace\": \"Slow-burn, deliberate and authoritative.\",\n    \"transitions\": \"Use environmental transitions, shadows, reflections, darkness, moisture and material textures rather than digital wipes or flashy effects.\",\n    \"prohibited\": [\n      \"rapid montage\",\n      \"action editing\",\n      \"battle imagery\",\n      \"modern lens-flare transitions\",\n      \"digital HUD elements\",\n      \"glitch effects\",\n      \"fantasy magical particles\",\n      \"excessive slow motion\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"FINAL_DIRECTIVE\": \"Create a ten-second opening-title sequence that feels unmistakably rooted in the ancient Andaman and Nicobar Islands. The visual storytelling must be based on landscape, sea, monsoon, forest, materials, craftsmanship and human presence. It should feel historically respectful, culturally specific, tactile and cinematic, with no borrowed imagery from unrelated ancient civilizations. The result should resemble the opening moments of an acclaimed Hollywood historical drama: visually restrained but monumental, emotionally tense, physically realistic and sonically earth-shattering. The title THE ISLAND OF TIDES must be the final unforgettable image, held in absolute stillness through the final frame.\"\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2094160586024325120/img/J_HWGth3nosxOM4L.jpg"]},{"i":18952,"text":"to video:\nUse @[Image1] as storyboard reference for cinematic sequence. use as first shot 01\n\nA 10-second luxurious cinematic journey through all 5 storyboard panels in strict order. Visual style: photorealistic 8K, ethereal coastal dreamscape, vibrant turquoise waters, golden hour lighting, butterfly effects, premium travel commercial aesthetic, HDR color grading, cinematic depth of field. CRITICAL: NO frames, borders, film strips, numbers, UI, text, or logos. Render as seamless full-screen shots only. Ignore grid layout. Use fluid camera movements and natural light transitions.\nShot 1 (0-2.0s): Low-angle glide over white sand towards iridescent sea turtle near gentle waves. White cliffs in soft bokeh background. Camera lifts and pushes forward along shoreline. Water sparkles in sunlight.\nShot 2 (2.0-4.0s): Camera reveals graceful woman in ethereal butterfly dress dancing at water's edge. Butterflies swirl around her as waves lap at her feet. Sun-drenched atmosphere with lens flare and god rays.\nShot 3 (4.0-6.0s): Transition to open sea. Elegant sailboat glides across turquoise waters under golden sunset sky. Seabirds soar in distance. Camera tracks alongside vessel at water level.\nShot 4 (6.0-8.0s): Sun dips lower, casting liquid gold reflection on water. Sailboat moves forward, sails catching\n\nmodel: Nano Banana 2 \n🏞 Prompt to image:⤵️","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQz2-q-XUAA5VpH.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQz2eoZXQAAEMxr.jpg"]},{"i":18953,"text":"A breathtaking digital art piece featuring a vibrant tropical scene framed within a circular portal. A tall, lush palm tree with teal and golden fronds leans gracefully over a serene ocean landscape at sunset. The horizon glows with a warm, golden sun, casting reflections on the gentle waves. Two elegant, glossy blue dolphins are captured in mid-motion, one leaping through the circular frame and the other gliding near the shimmering shoreline. The composition is infused with magical, iridescent water splashes and sparkling particles that swirl around the edges. The foreground features a dreamy, liquid-like beach transition with soft gradients of pink, orange, and purple, blending seamlessly into the water. The overall atmosphere is ethereal, peaceful, and vibrant, with high-contrast lighting that highlights the textures of the dolphins' skin and the swaying palm leaves. Intricate details, cinematic color palette, surreal fantasy aesthetic, ultra-high resolution, dreamy lighting, digital illustration style","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQz2-q-XUAA5VpH.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQz2eoZXQAAEMxr.jpg"]},{"i":18954,"text":"x VOL.073\n\n不知不觉，熬了73种风格了\n\n这组也很好特色，很喜欢垂直方向的脚手架逻辑\n这样不至于让画面过于匠气\n\n本组GitHub项目地址：\n\n完整提示词：\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、姿态、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览图像质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片主体最具识别度的**轮廓、结构、姿态与叙事关系**，重构为一组 **3D miniature architectural landscape** 风格的极简艺术画面：以 **isometric view / cut cube composition / perspective of an underwater continental shelf** 的方式呈现，主体像一个被剖开的微缩立体场景，具有正确的等距视图与清晰空间层级。整体以**微缩灯塔景观**为核心语义，可根据原图主体特征灵活转译，但必须保留一眼可辨的识别性与原始叙事关系。\n\n下半部分不是写实插画，而是将主体压缩为**简洁几何形状、扁平色块、细线条与留白**的抽象化表达；在极简基础上保留适度丰富的结构细节，使画面兼具建筑图解感与艺术海报感。主体应像一件置于白色纹理纸上的微型立体模型，带有 **hand-drawn architectural illustration** 气质：线条精细、层次清楚、细节克制而准确，避免厚重真实渲染。\n\n画面中加入明确的**脚手架逻辑**，参考你提供的图像：脚手架不是随意装饰，而应作为包裹、支撑、搭建或介入主体结构的理性系统，与主体共同形成空间秩序。脚手架可由细密的水平、垂直构件与局部连接节点组成，围绕主体外轮廓、关键转折或立体切面展开，呈现一种“正在被建构、修复、测绘或展示”的感觉；视图必须准确，透视关系清晰，不要画成漂浮拼贴。\n\n构图保持**主体居中、画面平衡、秩序克制**，并通过少量水平线、纵向构图线、环形元素或剖面边界增强空间感。背景使用**白色纹理纸或极浅米白纸面**，干净、安静、无阴影或仅有极弱的结构层次，不要厚重投影。保留大面积留白，让主体像悬浮于展览图录或建筑研究海报的版面中。\n\n配色从上方照片中提取灵感，但需重新处理为**更明艳、清透、治愈且有生命力**的高级色系，而不是直接照搬原始色值。保留原图的色相线索后，适度提亮、提纯、去灰，使颜色更鲜活、更轻盈；可形成清澈蓝、湖水青、嫩绿、明黄、珊瑚橙、桃粉、淡紫等柔和而明快的综合色关系，通过冷暖对比与明度节奏建立精致层次。避免灰脏、暗沉、发旧、莫兰迪化、廉价糖果色和塑料感。\n\n文字可少量介入，加入简洁的英文标题、编号或年份，并与主体、脚手架或留白形成自然的排版关系。文字应精致、现代、克制，像国际设计工作室、建筑海报、艺术展览海报和高端品牌视觉系统中的编辑性标注，不喧宾夺主。\n\n整体风格呈现**高级、现代、雅致、克制、艺术化**的视觉效果，融合微缩立体景观、建筑剖面图、等距视图、脚手架系统与极简海报版式。避免过度滤镜、廉价塑料质感、卡通感、强电脑生成感、模板化效果、错误视图和无逻辑的装饰性结构。\n\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ0Z2V4bwAAGMw5.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ0Z34nb0AAXuAU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ0Z5GCbUAAlHCL.jpg"]},{"i":18955,"text":"使用图一作为唯一内容参考，创作一张宽高比三比四的单幅“照片续写”视觉。\n\n保留图一上方约百分之五十的真实照片区域，严格保持人物面部、发型、服装、姿态、主体结构、场景透视与光线方向一致。\n\n从画面中部的自然边界开始，例如地平线、桌沿、衣摆、道路或建筑基座，让真实影像逐渐过渡为暖白色手工纸张。\n\n照片中的轮廓、道路、人物身体或物体边缘必须准确穿过边界，并在纸面上继续延伸成【彩色铅笔／蜡笔／水彩／钢笔手稿】。\n\n手绘区域续写【尚未发生的场景／人物愿望／制作过程／空间结构／旅行路线】，保留清楚可见的纸纤维、铅笔试线、蜡笔堆色、轻微擦除、胶带与不规则手工边缘。\n\n手绘颜色从真实照片中提取，控制在三至五种。照片与手稿共享同一个主体、透视和空间方向，不是两张无关图片的拼贴。\n\n禁止生硬直线分屏、前后对比图、宫格、相框套图、重复人物、面部变化、上下透视断裂、过多便签、虚假长文字和儿童作业感。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n照片负责证明“这件事真实发生过”，手稿负责表达“这段记忆后来长成了什么”。\n\n真正的关键不是一半照片、一半绘画，而是边界两侧能够互相接住：\n\n一条道路继续延伸，一个动作继续完成，一段人生继续向前。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n• 儿童旧照续写成年后的梦想\n• 旅行照片续写未走完的路线\n• 建筑实景续写设计草图与内部空间\n• 成衣照片续写裁剪、缝制与纹样手稿\n• 菜肴照片续写原料、火候与制作过程\n• 产品成品续写最初的概念草模\n\n⚙️ 关键控制点\n\n真实与手绘区域保持四比六至六比四，不要让其中一层只剩装饰边角。\n\n至少安排两条轮廓跨过边界，才能建立连续感。手绘区域只续写一个信息任务，不要同时加入地图、配方、时间轴和大量说明。\n\n涉及真实历史、建筑复原或工艺流程时，应依据资料绘制；不确定的部分明确作为想象性续写。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n照片记录已经发生的瞬间，手稿替它画出仍在生长的以后。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ3DndtbUAAjxgi.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ3Dnd4akAAMKVV.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ3Dnd4bAAAXPlB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ3Dnd1bwAA5zbS.jpg"]},{"i":18956,"text":"Shattered-reflections editorial style. \n\n[ Portrait Series - Part 2 ]\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"prompt_name\": \"Shattered Reflections Portrait\",\n  \"shot_type\": \"hyper-realistic frontal close-up portrait\",\n  \"composition\": \"centered, symmetrical, magazine-cover framing\",\n  \"subject\": \"Paul Rudd\",\n  \"subject_expression\": \"calm, neutral, direct eye contact with camera\",\n  \"concept\": \"the subject's face surrounded by suspended, broken mirror shards floating in the air, each fragment showing the same person but displaying a different raw emotion\",\n  \"emotions_in_shards\": [\n    \"happiness / open laughter\",\n    \"fury / rage\",\n    \"intense screaming\",\n    \"grief / sorrow\",\n    \"shock\",\n    \"determination\"\n  ],\n  \"glass_details\": \"jagged razor-sharp broken mirror pieces, hyper-clear glass with realistic light refraction and distortion, tiny drifting glass dust and slivers, crisp reflective surfaces\",\n  \"background\": \"moody deep navy-black studio backdrop, minimal texture\",\n  \"lighting\": \"high-contrast cinematic lighting, soft key light on the main face, gentle rim light separating subject from background, volumetric light rays\",\n  \"skin_and_detail\": \"photoreal skin texture, visible pores, ultra-detailed iris and eyes, natural imperfections\",\n  \"render_style\": \"photorealistic editorial photography, Octane Render, Unreal Engine 5 quality, ray-traced reflections, cinematic color grading\",\n  \"camera_specs\": \"85mm lens, f/1.8 aperture, shallow depth of field, tack-sharp focus\",\n  \"quality_tags\": [\"8K\", \"HDR\", \"masterpiece\", \"ultra sharp focus\", \"premium editorial photography\"]\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTOoZDmbYAEAjQ9.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTOoZDibEAAesdx.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTOoZDjbEAA3IBG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTOoZDkaYAAvS0k.jpg"]},{"i":18957,"text":"Floating glass shards + cinematic close-up lighting + photoreal skin detail = an editorial portrait style built for attention. \n\nUse it whenever a simple image needs to communicate intensity, inner conflict, or a powerful backstory.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ50wkFagAATK_N.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ50wkEbIAANd2n.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ50wkLa4AE3_oS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ50wkCbMAAd8GK.jpg"]},{"i":18958,"text":"🎯 核心提示词\n\n使用图1作为角色唯一身份参考，制作一套可直接用于社交平台的角色反应包。\n\n严格保持角色的脸型、五官、发型、发色、肤色、年龄、身体比例、服装结构、配色、材质及标志性配件。不得擅自萌化、幼化、换装或重新设计角色。\n\n生成以下8种反应，每种输出为一张独立图片：\n\n① 收到：认真点头，右手确认手势\n② 震惊：身体后仰，双眼睁大\n③ 太强了：眼睛发亮，双手鼓掌\n④ 催更：探身向前，手指轻敲桌面\n⑤ 我来：挽起袖口，准备行动\n⑥ 救命：双手抱头，表情崩溃\n⑦ 稍等：一手制止，另一手忙碌操作\n⑧ 下班：瘫坐下来，灵魂离开身体般的轻微幽默效果\n\n动作幅度明显，但面部仍能准确认出原角色。根据每种情绪加入少量速度线、汗滴、火焰、问号或震动符号，所有效果不得遮挡脸部。\n\n每张采用1:1画幅、单角色、完整轮廓、透明背景、白色贴纸描边与轻微投影，适合缩小到聊天表情尺寸。\n\n只允许出现对应的两个至三个中文字符；文字位于角色下方，粗体、清楚、无错字。禁止九宫格、贴纸合集、白色画布、多余人物、重复姿势、错误手指和随机文字。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n可以制作品牌客服反应包、创作者评论区回复、影视角色宣发表情、游戏角色社群素材，以及IP的日常运营用图。\n\n⚙️ 关键控制点\n\n先生成一张“收到”测试身份稳定性，通过后再逐张扩展。每次只改变表情、手势和特效，不改变服装与身体比例。\n\n文字容易出错时先生成无字透明贴纸，再统一后期添加中文。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ9lRgSbQAA5Uec.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ9lRgJaoAAMLNg.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ9lRgTacAAMyk_.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQ9lRgebQAAOH7Z.jpg"]},{"i":18959,"text":"🍕 Under construction. \n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"video_duration\": \"10 seconds\",\n  \"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\",\n  \"sequence\": [\n    {\n      \"time\": \"0-2 sec\",\n      \"scene\": \"Grand Setup\",\n      \"camera\": \"Wide cinematic aerial push-in\",\n      \"action\": \"A huge freshly baked pizza rests on a wooden table like a massive construction site. Dozens of tiny workers rush in with miniature loaders, cranes, delivery trucks, and equipment, preparing to build the perfect pizza.\",\n      \"sound_design\": \"Bright playful music, tiny engine noises, rolling wheels, subtle construction activity.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"time\": \"2-4 sec\",\n      \"scene\": \"Sauce and Cheese Layer\",\n      \"camera\": \"Medium side-tracking shot\",\n      \"action\": \"A miniature food truck pumps rich red tomato sauce across the pizza while tiny workers spread it smoothly with small spatulas. Another team follows behind, covering the surface with a thick layer of shredded mozzarella.\",\n      \"sound_design\": \"Soft sauce pouring, spatula scraping, cheese rustling, cheerful rhythmic music.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"time\": \"4-6 sec\",\n      \"scene\": \"Toppings in Motion\",\n      \"camera\": \"Macro close-up with gentle slow motion\",\n      \"action\": \"Tiny conveyor belts transport colorful ingredients including pepperoni, mushrooms, bell peppers, olives, and fresh basil. The miniature workers carefully arrange each topping across the cheesy surface with precision.\",\n      \"sound_design\": \"Conveyor belt movement, tiny ingredient drops, delicate magical chimes, upbeat musical accents.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"time\": \"6-8 sec\",\n      \"scene\": \"Final Ingredient Lift\",\n      \"camera\": \"Low-angle dramatic cinematic shot\",\n      \"action\": \"A miniature crane raises an oversized pepperoni slice toward the center of the pizza. Workers below pull guide ropes and signal to one another as the topping is slowly positioned into place.\",\n      \"sound_design\": \"Small crane motor, rope tension sounds, mechanical clicks, rising cinematic orchestral music.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"time\": \"8-10 sec\",\n      \"scene\": \"Pizza Grand Finale\",\n      \"camera\": \"Smooth 360-degree orbit close-up\",\n      \"action\": \"The final topping drops perfectly into position. A burst of colorful confetti fills the miniature world as the tiny workers cheer and celebrate. The camera sweeps around the finished pizza, revealing its glossy melted cheese, colorful toppings, and golden crust before ending on a satisfying hero shot.\",\n      \"sound_design\": \"Celebratory pop, joyful cheering, tiny whistles, uplifting orchestral finish.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"visual_style\": {\n    \"animation_quality\": \"Pixar-inspired premium 3D animation\",\n    \"world_design\": \"Charming miniature construction world built around an oversized pizza\",\n    \"color_palette\": \"Warm reds, golden browns, creamy cheese tones, and bright colorful toppings\",\n    \"lighting\": \"Soft warm golden illumination with gentle cinematic highlights\",\n    \"detail\": \"Highly detailed food textures, miniature machinery, realistic cheese melt, crisp toppings, and expressive tiny characters\",\n    \"camera\": \"Fluid cinematic motion, macro photography feel, smooth transitions, shallow depth of field\",\n    \"overall_feel\": \"Cute, playful, visually satisfying, polished, premium, and whimsical\",\n    \"resolution\": \"720p\"\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2094160586024325120/img/J_HWGth3nosxOM4L.jpg"]}];